- I hope you're proud of yourself.

@rule day.h.hungry_nolunch
on day
when mood=hungry
hook hungry_nolunch
opens invite,ask,tease
feel sad
fit tease=neutral invite=neutral
- My lunch money's gone. Today's a tragedy.
- I forgot my bento at home. This is the worst.
- I left my lunch on the kitchen table. I can see it in my mind.
- I've got no lunch today. Not one crumb.

@rule react.h.hungry_nolunch.bad
on react
when hook=hungry_nolunch fit=bad
