fit tease=neutral invite=neutral
- Finally, lunch. I've been waiting for this all morning.
- Lunch! I'm going to eat so much.
- I've planned this lunch since second period. Don't judge the amount.
- Thank god, lunch. Don't get between me and the food.

@rule react.h.lunch_ready.bad
on react
when hook=lunch_ready fit=bad
