@rule move.h.lunch_ready.invite
on move.invite
when hook=lunch_ready
- Ask if you can eat with her

@rule react.h.lunch_ready.invite
on react
when hook=lunch_ready move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Come on, then. The good spot goes fast.
- Good. Bring your own, I'm not sharing. Okay, maybe a little.
- Yes! Let's go before the line gets long.

@rule move.h.lunch_ready.ask
on move.ask
when hook=lunch_ready
- Ask what she's getting

@rule react.h.lunch_ready.ask
on react
