@rule day.h.lunch_rush
on day
when mood=hungry period=lunch
hook lunch_rush
opens invite,share,tease
fit tease=neutral invite=neutral
- The melon bread will be gone if we talk too long. Hurry!
- The line at the store is my only enemy today. Walk with me?
- The bell rang and I need to get to the store. Let's go.

@rule react.h.lunch_rush.bad
on react
when hook=lunch_rush fit=bad
- No time for that! The bread!
