@rule day.h.bored_clock
on day
when mood=bored
hook bored_clock
opens ask,invite,tease
fit tease=neutral
- Every class felt three hours long. I've been staring at the clock all day.
- I think the clock's going backward. Help.
- Slow. So slow. Today's never going to end.
- If this day were a movie, I'd have left already.

@rule react.h.bored_clock.bad
on react
when hook=bored_clock fit=bad
