- The one after lunch. It never ends.
- Math. The teacher read from the book. All of it.

@rule move.h.bored_clock.invite
on move.invite
when hook=bored_clock
- Suggest doing something after class

@rule react.h.bored_clock.invite
on react
when hook=bored_clock move=invite fit=good|neutral
