@rule move.h.stressed_todo.ask
on move.ask
when hook=stressed_todo
- Ask what's at the top of the list

@rule react.h.stressed_todo.ask
on react
when hook=stressed_todo move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Everything's at the top. That's the problem.
- Mostly {mything}. Saying it out loud helps a little.
- Today? More than I can fit. Tomorrow's worse.

@rule move.h.stressed_todo.invite
on move.invite
when hook=stressed_todo
- Offer to help her with it

@rule react.h.stressed_todo.invite
on react
when hook=stressed_todo move=invite fit=good|neutral
