- My stomach's in knots about {mything}.
- I feel like I'm falling behind on {mything}.

@rule react.h.stressed_worry.bad
on react
when hook=stressed_worry fit=bad
- That's not helping. My head's already full.
- I can't think about that on top of everything.

@rule move.h.stressed_worry.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=stressed_worry
- Say she's doing better than she thinks

@rule react.h.stressed_worry.comfort
on react
when hook=stressed_worry move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- You think so? I can't tell from in here.
- Maybe. Thanks for saying it.
- That helps more than you'd think.

@rule move.h.stressed_worry.ask
on move.ask
when hook=stressed_worry
- Ask what worries her most about it

@rule react.h.stressed_worry.ask
on react
when hook=stressed_worry move=ask fit=good|neutral
- That I'll let people down. That's the honest answer.
- I don't know, that's the worst part.
- It's not one thing. It just keeps piling up.

@rule move.h.stressed_worry.invite
on move.invite
when hook=stressed_worry
- Suggest a walk to clear her head

@rule react.h.stressed_worry.invite
on react
when hook=stressed_worry move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Okay. Maybe my head will shut up outside.
- Yeah. I've been indoors too long.
- Five minutes. Then back to panicking.

@rule day.h.stressed_mask
on day
when mood=stressed
hook stressed_mask
opens comfort,ask,invite
feel worried
- I smile and say it's fine. I don't feel fine.
- Everyone thinks I've got it under control. I don't.
- I keep acting like everything's okay. It's getting hard.

@rule react.h.stressed_mask.bad
on react
when hook=stressed_mask fit=bad
- See? This is why I just say it's fine.
- Forget it. I'm fine. Really.

@rule move.h.stressed_mask.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=stressed_mask
- Tell her she can drop the act with you

@rule react.h.stressed_mask.comfort
on react
when hook=stressed_mask move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...You're the first person to say that.
- Okay. Thank you. I'll try.
- I didn't think it showed.

@rule move.h.stressed_mask.ask
on move.ask
when hook=stressed_mask
- Ask how long she's been keeping it up

@rule react.h.stressed_mask.ask
on react
when hook=stressed_mask move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A while. I'm good at it, sadly.
- Since the start of the week, at least.
- I stopped counting.

@rule move.h.stressed_mask.invite
on move.invite
when hook=stressed_mask
- Offer to hide somewhere with her for a bit

@rule react.h.stressed_mask.invite
on react
when hook=stressed_mask move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes. Somewhere nobody can find me.
- That's the kindest offer I've had all day.
- Ten minutes. Thank you.

@rule day.h.stressed_favors
on day
when mood=stressed
hook stressed_favors
opens comfort,ask,tease
feel worried
- Everyone needs something from me today. I can't say no.
- If one more person asks me for something... I'll scream.
- I've been running errands for people since this morning.

@rule react.h.stressed_favors.bad
on react
when hook=stressed_favors fit=bad
- That's one more thing. No.
- Not you too. Please.

@rule move.h.stressed_favors.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=stressed_favors
- Say she's allowed to say no

@rule react.h.stressed_favors.comfort
on react
when hook=stressed_favors move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- I know. Knowing it and doing it are different.
- Tell that to them. ...Thanks.
- You make it sound easy. It helps, though.

@rule move.h.stressed_favors.ask
on move.ask
when hook=stressed_favors
- Ask who keeps asking her for things

@rule react.h.stressed_favors.ask
on react
when hook=stressed_favors move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Everyone. Classmates, teachers. They mean well.
- Whoever finds me first.
- It'd be faster to list who hasn't.

@rule move.h.stressed_favors.tease
on move.tease
when hook=stressed_favors
- Ask her to do one more little thing

@rule react.h.stressed_favors.tease
on react
when hook=stressed_favors move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I will end you.
- Don't. Even.
- Ha. ...Ha. I hate you a little.

@rule day.h.exam_blank
on day
when mood=stressed exam=yes
hook exam_blank
opens comfort,ask,invite
feel worried
- The exams. I studied all night and I still feel like I know nothing.
- I keep blanking on everything. I'm doomed.
- I've read this chapter five times. Nothing's sticking.
- I memorized it this morning and it's already gone.

@rule react.h.exam_blank.bad
on react
when hook=exam_blank fit=bad
- I can't. If I stop reviewing, I'll lose what's left.
- Not now. Whatever I still remember is about to fall out.

@rule move.h.exam_blank.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=exam_blank
- Say she knows more than she thinks

@rule react.h.exam_blank.comfort
on react
when hook=exam_blank move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- You sound so sure. I wish I were.
- Maybe it's in there somewhere. Thanks.
- I'll hold on to that.

@rule move.h.exam_blank.ask
on move.ask
when hook=exam_blank
- Ask which subject is the problem

@rule react.h.exam_blank.ask
on react
when hook=exam_blank move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Math. No, history. No, everything with numbers.
- All of them, but mostly the one tomorrow.
- The second half of the book. It just slides off my brain.

@rule move.h.exam_blank.invite
on move.invite
when hook=exam_blank
- Offer to study together

@rule react.h.exam_blank.invite
on react
when hook=exam_blank move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Would you? Yes. Please.
- Okay, but don't laugh at my answers.
- Two heads might hold more than one.

@rule day.h.exam_panic
on day
when mood=stressed exam=yes
hook exam_panic
opens comfort,ask,share
feel worried
- Everyone in class is pretending not to panic. Me included.
- The whole room smells like fear and highlighters.
- I'm so nervous about the exams I can't sit still.
- I dreamed about the exam. I got it wrong.

@rule react.h.exam_panic.bad
on react
when hook=exam_panic fit=bad
- That's really not what I need to hear this week.
- You're making me more nervous.

@rule move.h.exam_panic.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=exam_panic
- Say everyone's scared too

@rule react.h.exam_panic.comfort
on react
when hook=exam_panic move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- That actually helps. A little.
- You're right. Nobody looks okay.
- Okay. Then I'm not the only one.

@rule move.h.exam_panic.ask
on move.ask
when hook=exam_panic
- Ask how she's sleeping

@rule react.h.exam_panic.ask
on react
when hook=exam_panic move=ask fit=good|neutral
- What's that?
- I dream about question ten.
- Badly. Thanks for asking.

@rule move.h.exam_panic.share
on move.share
when hook=exam_panic
- Admit you're scared too

@rule react.h.exam_panic.share
on react
when hook=exam_panic move=share fit=good|neutral
- You? Really? I feel better and I'm sorry about it.
- Then we can sink together.
- Okay. It's not just me, then.

@rule day.h.exam_quiz
on day
when mood=stressed exam=yes
hook exam_quiz
opens share,ask,invite
- Exam week is killing me. Are you ready?
- Everyone's panicking. How are you so calm?
- Did you finish the review sheet? Tell me you did.
- How's your studying going? Be honest. Don't be honest.

@rule react.h.exam_quiz.bad
on react
when hook=exam_quiz fit=bad
- Forget I asked.
- That's the last thing I need right before the exams.

@rule move.h.exam_quiz.share
on move.share
when hook=exam_quiz
- Tell her how your studying is going

@rule react.h.exam_quiz.share
on react
when hook=exam_quiz move=share fit=good|neutral
- That's better than mine. I hate you a little.
- Okay, I can beat that. Maybe.
- Then we're in the same boat.

@rule move.h.exam_quiz.ask
on move.ask
when hook=exam_quiz
- Ask how her review is going

@rule react.h.exam_quiz.ask
on react
when hook=exam_quiz move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Half done. The bad half is left.
- Don't ask. No, you can ask. It's bad.
- I stopped looking at the score.

@rule move.h.exam_quiz.invite
on move.invite
when hook=exam_quiz
- Suggest reviewing together

@rule react.h.exam_quiz.invite
on react
when hook=exam_quiz move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes. Library, after class?
- Good idea. You check mine, I'll check yours.
- Bring snacks and we have a deal.

@rule day.h.stressed_club
on day
when mood=stressed period=after|club
hook stressed_club
opens comfort,ask,invite
feel worried
- The {club} is a mess right now. We're behind on everything.
- Half the {club} didn't show up. So it's all on me.
- We've got a deadline at the {club}. I can't do it alone.
- Nobody's doing their part at the {club}.

@rule react.h.stressed_club.bad
on react
when hook=stressed_club fit=bad
- You're not the one who has to clean this up.
- That doesn't fix anything at the club.

@rule move.h.stressed_club.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=stressed_club
- Say it's not all on her

@rule react.h.stressed_club.comfort
on react
when hook=stressed_club move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- I wish they'd tell me that.
- Hearing that from you helps.
- Doesn't feel like it, but thanks.

@rule move.h.stressed_club.ask
on move.ask
when hook=stressed_club
- Ask what's left to do

@rule react.h.stressed_club.ask
on react
when hook=stressed_club move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Everything, basically. Ask me which part isn't a disaster.
- It's not even hard work, there's just so much of it.
- More than we have days for.

@rule move.h.stressed_club.invite
on move.invite
when hook=stressed_club
- Offer to lend a hand

@rule react.h.stressed_club.invite
on react
when hook=stressed_club move=invite fit=good|neutral
- You'd do that? Okay. I owe you.
- I'll take any help I can get.
- Careful, I might say yes.

@rule day.h.stressed_clubdoubt
on day
when mood=stressed period=after|club
hook stressed_clubdoubt
opens comfort,ask,share
feel worried
- I used to love the {club}. It's not fun lately.
- I joined the {club} to have fun, you know? What happened?
- The {club} feels like a job lately. I want to run away.

@rule react.h.stressed_clubdoubt.bad
on react
when hook=stressed_clubdoubt fit=bad
- You don't get it. I really loved that club.
- Never mind. I shouldn't have brought it up.

@rule move.h.stressed_clubdoubt.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=stressed_clubdoubt
- Say a bad patch doesn't change that

@rule react.h.stressed_clubdoubt.comfort
on react
when hook=stressed_clubdoubt move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Maybe it comes back. I hope so.
- I needed to hear that.
- Thank you. I'm not sure I believe it yet.

@rule move.h.stressed_clubdoubt.ask
on move.ask
when hook=stressed_clubdoubt
- Ask when it stopped being fun

@rule react.h.stressed_clubdoubt.ask
on react
when hook=stressed_clubdoubt move=ask fit=good|neutral
- When it turned into a list of things to do.
- I don't know. That's what scares me.
- Around the time people stopped laughing.

@rule move.h.stressed_clubdoubt.share
on move.share
when hook=stressed_clubdoubt
- Say you've felt like quitting things too

@rule react.h.stressed_clubdoubt.share
on react
when hook=stressed_clubdoubt move=share fit=good|neutral
- So it's normal. Good to know.
- What did you do? No, don't tell me yet.
- Thanks for not telling me to just cheer up.

@rule day.h.lonely_alone
on day
when mood=lonely
hook lonely_alone
opens comfort,ask,invite
feel sad
- Kind of lonely, actually. I ate by myself.
- My friends were all busy today.
- It's been a long day by myself.
- I haven't really talked to anyone today. Until now, I guess.

@rule react.h.lonely_alone.bad
on react
when hook=lonely_alone fit=bad
- Oh. I'd rather go back to being alone, then.
- Maybe I was better off not talking.

@rule move.h.lonely_alone.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=lonely_alone
- Say you'll keep her company

@rule react.h.lonely_alone.comfort
on react
when hook=lonely_alone move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...Thanks. That's nice to hear.
- Okay. Stay a little, then.
- That helps. Really.

@rule move.h.lonely_alone.ask
on move.ask
when hook=lonely_alone
- Ask where her friends went

@rule react.h.lonely_alone.ask
on react
when hook=lonely_alone move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Clubs, boyfriends, who knows. Everyone had somewhere to be.
- They're around. They just didn't look for me.
- I didn't ask. It felt like asking for too much.

@rule move.h.lonely_alone.invite
on move.invite
when hook=lonely_alone
- Ask her to eat with you next time

@rule react.h.lonely_alone.invite
on react
when hook=lonely_alone move=invite fit=good|neutral
- You mean it? I'll remember that.
- I'd like that. A lot.
- Okay. Don't forget, now.

@rule day.h.lonely_oddone
on day
when mood=lonely
hook lonely_oddone
opens comfort,ask,invite
feel sad
- Everyone paired up in class but me. It's fine.
- I ended up the odd one out in group work. It happens.
- We had to get into groups today, and I was left over.

@rule react.h.lonely_oddone.bad
on react
when hook=lonely_oddone fit=bad
- I said it's fine. Let's drop it.
- Right. I guess that's why nobody picks me.

@rule move.h.lonely_oddone.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=lonely_oddone
- Say that would've bothered you too

@rule react.h.lonely_oddone.comfort
on react
when hook=lonely_oddone move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...It did bother me. Thanks for noticing.
- You don't have to say that. But thank you.
- Okay. Maybe it matters a little.

@rule move.h.lonely_oddone.ask
on move.ask
when hook=lonely_oddone
- Ask what happened in group work

@rule react.h.lonely_oddone.ask
on react
when hook=lonely_oddone move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Nothing, that's the thing. Nobody was mean. They just didn't look over.
- I ended up doing the work alone. It was fine.
- The teacher put me in a group of two. Awkward.

@rule move.h.lonely_oddone.invite
on move.invite
when hook=lonely_oddone
- Offer to be her partner next time

@rule react.h.lonely_oddone.invite
on react
when hook=lonely_oddone move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Are you sure? Then I'll hold you to it.
- ...Yes. I'd like that.
- Okay. I'll look for you.

@rule day.h.lonely_invisible
on day
when mood=lonely
hook lonely_invisible
opens comfort,share,ask
feel sad
- The classroom feels big when nobody talks to you.
- Break time is long when you're alone.
- Do you ever feel invisible? Today's like that.
- You're the first person I've really talked to today. That's a little embarrassing.

@rule react.h.lonely_invisible.bad
on react
when hook=lonely_invisible fit=bad
- I shouldn't have said anything.
- Invisible was better than this.

@rule move.h.lonely_invisible.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=lonely_invisible
- Say you're glad you came over

@rule react.h.lonely_invisible.comfort
on react
when hook=lonely_invisible move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Me too.
- You did? ...Thank you.
- That's enough to fix a whole day, you know.

@rule move.h.lonely_invisible.share
on move.share
when hook=lonely_invisible
- Say you've felt that way too

@rule react.h.lonely_invisible.share
on react
when hook=lonely_invisible move=share fit=good|neutral
- Really? You don't seem the type.
- So I'm not the only one.
- Thanks. It's easier to hear from someone who knows.

@rule move.h.lonely_invisible.ask
on move.ask
when hook=lonely_invisible
- Ask what would help

@rule react.h.lonely_invisible.ask
on react
when hook=lonely_invisible move=ask fit=good|neutral
- This helps. Talking. Nothing fancy.
- I don't really know. You could keep asking.
- Just this. Don't go yet.

@rule day.h.lonely_missyou
on day
when mood=lonely rel=girlfriend|lover
hook lonely_missyou
opens comfort,ask,invite
feel sad
- I missed you today. It's lonely when you're not around.
- I kept looking for you between classes.
- The day felt so long without you.
- Everything's quieter without you.

@rule react.h.lonely_missyou.bad
on react
when hook=lonely_missyou fit=bad
- I tell you that, and that's what you say?
- Did you even think of me at all today?

@rule move.h.lonely_missyou.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=lonely_missyou
- Say you missed her too

@rule react.h.lonely_missyou.comfort
on react
when hook=lonely_missyou move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Good. Then we're even.
- Mm. That's better.
- Don't go yet.

@rule move.h.lonely_missyou.ask
on move.ask
when hook=lonely_missyou
- Ask how you can make up for it

@rule react.h.lonely_missyou.ask
on react
when hook=lonely_missyou move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Stay a little. That's all.
- You could start by not leaving.
- I'll think of something. It won't be cheap.

@rule move.h.lonely_missyou.invite
on move.invite
when hook=lonely_missyou
- Promise lunch tomorrow

@rule react.h.lonely_missyou.invite
on react
when hook=lonely_missyou move=invite fit=good|neutral
- You'd better. I'll save you a seat.
- I'll hold you to that.
- Yes. Please.

@rule day.h.lonely_needyou
on day
when mood=lonely rel=girlfriend|lover
hook lonely_needyou
opens invite,comfort,ask
feel sad
- Are you free after school? I don't want to go alone.
- Can we walk home together? Please?
- Stay with me after class today. I don't want to be by myself.

@rule react.h.lonely_needyou.bad
on react
when hook=lonely_needyou fit=bad
- ...Forget I asked.
- I thought you'd understand, of all people.

@rule move.h.lonely_needyou.invite
on move.invite
when hook=lonely_needyou
- Say you'll walk home with her

@rule react.h.lonely_needyou.invite
on react
when hook=lonely_needyou move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Really? Okay. I'll wait at the gate.
- That makes my whole day.
- I knew you would.

@rule move.h.lonely_needyou.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=lonely_needyou
- Say you always have time for her

@rule react.h.lonely_needyou.comfort
on react
when hook=lonely_needyou move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Liar. A sweet liar. Thank you.
- Mm. Say that again later.
- Good answer.

@rule move.h.lonely_needyou.ask
on move.ask
when hook=lonely_needyou
- Ask if something's wrong

@rule react.h.lonely_needyou.ask
on react
when hook=lonely_needyou move=ask fit=good|neutral
- No. I just want you close today.
- Not really. It's just been that kind of day.
- Do I need a reason?

@rule day.h.flirty_gladyou
on day
when mood=flirty
hook flirty_gladyou
opens praise,tease,invite
feel smile
- Better now that you're here.
- Mm, it just got better.
- I was hoping you'd show up.
- I had a feeling I'd see you. And here you are.

@rule react.h.flirty_gladyou.bad
on react
when hook=flirty_gladyou fit=bad
- And here I was, glad to see you.
- Hm. It just got worse.

@rule move.h.flirty_gladyou.praise
on move.praise
when hook=flirty_gladyou
- Say you were hoping to see her too

@rule react.h.flirty_gladyou.praise
on react
when hook=flirty_gladyou move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Were you, now?
- Careful. I'll believe you.
- That's what I like to hear.

@rule move.h.flirty_gladyou.tease
on move.tease
when hook=flirty_gladyou
- Ask if she says that to everyone

@rule react.h.flirty_gladyou.tease
on react
when hook=flirty_gladyou move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Only the ones who come back.
- Why, are you jealous?
- You'll have to find out.

@rule move.h.flirty_gladyou.invite
on move.invite
when hook=flirty_gladyou
- Ask her to spend the break with you

@rule react.h.flirty_gladyou.invite
on react
when hook=flirty_gladyou move=invite fit=good|neutral
- I thought you'd never ask.
- Mm. Lead the way.
- Anywhere's fine. I'm in a good mood.

@rule day.h.flirty_lookatme
on day
when mood=flirty
hook flirty_lookatme
opens praise,ask,tease
feel smile
- Do I look different today? Look closer.
- Notice anything? You're not trying hard enough.
- Look at me. Notice anything different?

@rule react.h.flirty_lookatme.bad
on react
when hook=flirty_lookatme fit=bad
- You're not even trying. Forget it.
- Never mind. Look somewhere else.

@rule move.h.flirty_lookatme.praise
on move.praise
when hook=flirty_lookatme
- Say she looks great today

@rule react.h.flirty_lookatme.praise
on react
when hook=flirty_lookatme move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Took you long enough.
- Hehe. You passed.
- Good. You do have eyes.

@rule move.h.flirty_lookatme.ask
on move.ask
when hook=flirty_lookatme
- Ask what's different

@rule react.h.flirty_lookatme.ask
on react
when hook=flirty_lookatme move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Figure it out. I'll wait.
- Everything. Nothing. Keep looking.
- If I told you, it wouldn't be fun.

@rule move.h.flirty_lookatme.tease
on move.tease
when hook=flirty_lookatme
- Say she looks the same as ever

@rule react.h.flirty_lookatme.tease
on react
when hook=flirty_lookatme move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Wrong answer.
- Oh, you're in trouble now.
- Hmph. Try again tomorrow.

@rule day.h.flirty_daydream
on day
when mood=flirty
hook flirty_daydream
opens ask,tease,invite
feel smile
- I can't focus on class today. Guess what about.
- I've been daydreaming all morning. Your fault, maybe.
- My mind keeps wandering today, and I know exactly where to.

@rule react.h.flirty_daydream.bad
on react
when hook=flirty_daydream fit=bad
- And just like that, I can focus again.
- Thanks. The daydream's over.

@rule move.h.flirty_daydream.ask
on move.ask
when hook=flirty_daydream
- Ask what she was daydreaming about

@rule react.h.flirty_daydream.ask
on react
when hook=flirty_daydream move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Mm. You'll have to earn that.
- A certain someone. Not telling.
- You really want to know?

@rule move.h.flirty_daydream.tease
on move.tease
when hook=flirty_daydream
- Say it's definitely your fault

@rule react.h.flirty_daydream.tease
on react
when hook=flirty_daydream move=tease fit=good|neutral
- So you admit it.
- Then you should take responsibility.
- Hehe. How confident.

@rule move.h.flirty_daydream.invite
on move.invite
when hook=flirty_daydream
- Offer to lend her your notes

@rule react.h.flirty_daydream.invite
on react
when hook=flirty_daydream move=invite fit=good|neutral
- How sweet. I'll need them, too.
- Hehe. You'd do that for me?
- That's a good excuse to see you later.

@rule day.h.sleepy_latenight
on day
when mood=sleepy
hook sleepy_latenight
opens ask,share,tease
fit tease=neutral
- I stayed up way too late last night.
- I was watching videos until three. Don't tell me off.
- I just couldn't put my phone down. One more, I said.
- Last night was a mistake. I need a nap, badly.

@rule react.h.sleepy_latenight.bad
on react
when hook=sleepy_latenight fit=bad
- I'm too tired for this.
- Scold me after my nap. Or don't.

@rule move.h.sleepy_latenight.ask
on move.ask
when hook=sleepy_latenight
- Ask what kept her up

@rule react.h.sleepy_latenight.ask
on react
when hook=sleepy_latenight move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Cat videos. Then how bridges are built. I don't know how.
- One more episode, then one more after that.
- I honestly can't remember the last hour.

@rule move.h.sleepy_latenight.share
on move.share
when hook=sleepy_latenight
- Admit you stayed up too

@rule react.h.sleepy_latenight.share
on react
when hook=sleepy_latenight move=share fit=good|neutral
- So you get it. One more always lies.
- Then why do you look fine? Unfair.
- Good. We're both idiots.

@rule move.h.sleepy_latenight.tease
on move.tease
when hook=sleepy_latenight
- Tell her off anyway

@rule react.h.sleepy_latenight.tease
on react
when hook=sleepy_latenight move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I said don't!
- You sound like my mother.
- I know, I know. Tomorrow I'll be good.

@rule day.h.sleepy_class
on day
when mood=sleepy
hook sleepy_class
opens ask,share,tease
fit tease=neutral
- I almost fell asleep in class.
- The teacher caught me nodding off.
- My notes turn into squiggles after the first line. I can't read them.
- I wrote half my notes in a straight line down the page.

@rule react.h.sleepy_class.bad
on react
when hook=sleepy_class fit=bad
- My head's too heavy for that.
- Mmh. I'm going to pretend I didn't hear that.

@rule move.h.sleepy_class.ask
on move.ask
when hook=sleepy_class
- Ask what she missed in class

@rule react.h.sleepy_class.ask
on react
when hook=sleepy_class move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Everything after page twelve.
- No idea. That's the problem with missing things.
- Something about a war, I think.

@rule move.h.sleepy_class.share
on move.share
when hook=sleepy_class
- Offer to lend her your notes

@rule react.h.sleepy_class.share
on react
when hook=sleepy_class move=share fit=good|neutral
- Would you? You just saved me.
- Yes, please. Mine look like a heart monitor.
- Thank you. I'll stay awake for that, at least.

@rule move.h.sleepy_class.tease
on move.tease
when hook=sleepy_class
- Say you heard her snoring

@rule react.h.sleepy_class.tease
on react
when hook=sleepy_class move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I do NOT snore! Do I?
- Don't you dare tell anyone.
- That was someone else. Definitely.

@rule day.h.sleepy_fading
on day
when mood=sleepy
hook sleepy_fading
opens invite,ask,tease
fit tease=neutral
- Coffee didn't work. Say something loud.
- I've been pinching myself awake. Help.
- My eyes keep closing. Talk slowly.
- If I lean on you, don't take it personally. I'm fading.

@rule react.h.sleepy_fading.bad
on react
when hook=sleepy_fading fit=bad
- You woke me up, and not in a good way.
- Not now. I'm barely standing.

@rule move.h.sleepy_fading.invite
on move.invite
when hook=sleepy_fading
- Offer to get her a coffee

@rule react.h.sleepy_fading.invite
on react
when hook=sleepy_fading move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Another one. Yes. Thank you.
- You're saving my life.
- Something strong, please.

@rule move.h.sleepy_fading.ask
on move.ask
when hook=sleepy_fading
- Ask how much she slept

@rule react.h.sleepy_fading.ask
on react
when hook=sleepy_fading move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Three hours? Is that a number?
- I'll let you know when I wake up.
- Not enough. Never enough.

@rule move.h.sleepy_fading.tease
on move.tease
when hook=sleepy_fading
- Poke her cheek to keep her awake

@rule react.h.sleepy_fading.tease
on react
when hook=sleepy_fading move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Do that again and I'll bite.
- You're lucky I'm too tired to chase you.
- ...Okay. That worked. I hate it.

@rule day.h.sleepy_clumsy
on day
when mood=sleepy
hook sleepy_clumsy
opens ask,share,tease
fit tease=neutral
- I put my shoes on the wrong feet this morning. I'm not okay.
- I got off the train one stop late. That's how tired.
- I walked into the wrong classroom. I sat down, too.

@rule react.h.sleepy_clumsy.bad
on react
when hook=sleepy_clumsy fit=bad
- It's been hard enough just getting through today.
- I can't. I've been a mess since I got up.

@rule move.h.sleepy_clumsy.ask
on move.ask
when hook=sleepy_clumsy
- Ask if she's okay

@rule react.h.sleepy_clumsy.ask
on react
when hook=sleepy_clumsy move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I'll live. Probably.
- Just tired. Don't worry. Thanks, though.
- Ask me after a nap.

@rule move.h.sleepy_clumsy.share
on move.share
when hook=sleepy_clumsy
- Tell her your worst sleepy mistake

@rule react.h.sleepy_clumsy.share
on react
when hook=sleepy_clumsy move=share fit=good|neutral
- Ha! You win. That's worse.
- I feel better about mine now.
- So it happens to everyone.

@rule move.h.sleepy_clumsy.tease
on move.tease
when hook=sleepy_clumsy
- Ask if she knows what day it is

@rule react.h.sleepy_clumsy.tease
on react
when hook=sleepy_clumsy move=tease fit=good|neutral
- It's... a weekday. Definitely.
- Don't push it.
- Don't confuse me, please.

@rule day.h.upset_noask
on day
when mood=upset
hook upset_noask
opens comfort,ask,share
feel pout
- Don't ask. Just one of those days.
- Bad. I don't want to talk about it.
- Terrible, okay? Can we not?
- I'd rather not get into it.

@rule react.h.upset_noask.bad
on react
when hook=upset_noask fit=bad
- I said I don't want to talk about it.
- Why can't you just leave it alone?

@rule move.h.upset_noask.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=upset_noask
- Say she doesn't have to talk

@rule react.h.upset_noask.comfort
on react
when hook=upset_noask move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Thanks. For not pushing.
- ...Okay. You can stay.
- Fine. Just don't look at me.

@rule move.h.upset_noask.ask
on move.ask
when hook=upset_noask
- Ask gently if it's something you did

@rule react.h.upset_noask.ask
on react
when hook=upset_noask move=ask fit=good|neutral
- No. It's not you.
- ...No. Not really.
- No. Sorry. I'm being difficult.

@rule move.h.upset_noask.share
on move.share
when hook=upset_noask
- Tell her something silly to distract her

@rule react.h.upset_noask.share
on react
when hook=upset_noask move=share fit=good|neutral
- ...That's stupid. Thanks.
- Keep going. It's working a little.
- Okay. That was almost funny.

@rule day.h.upset_holding
on day
when mood=upset
hook upset_holding
opens comfort,ask,share
feel pout
- I've been holding it in all day. It's exhausting.
- I smiled through the whole morning. I can't anymore.
- I'm tired of pretending I'm okay today.

@rule react.h.upset_holding.bad
on react
when hook=upset_holding fit=bad
- I can't do this right now.
- I held it in all day, and this is what I get?

@rule move.h.upset_holding.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=upset_holding
- Say she can stop smiling here

@rule react.h.upset_holding.comfort
on react
when hook=upset_holding move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...Okay. Then I will.
- Thank you. Sorry for the face.
- You're strange. Thanks.

@rule move.h.upset_holding.ask
on move.ask
when hook=upset_holding
- Ask what she's been holding in

@rule react.h.upset_holding.ask
on react
when hook=upset_holding move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I can't say it here. Not yet.
- If I start, I won't stop.
- Too much. Ask me another day.

@rule move.h.upset_holding.share
on move.share
when hook=upset_holding
- Say you've had days like that

@rule react.h.upset_holding.share
on react
when hook=upset_holding move=share fit=good|neutral
- Then you know there's nothing to say.
- It's nice not to have to explain.
- ...Yeah. I guess you would know.

@rule day.h.upset_badcompany
on day
when mood=upset
hook upset_badcompany
opens comfort,ask,share
feel pout
- I'm bad company today. Fair warning.
- If you came to cheer me up, it won't work.
- I'm not in the mood to be nice. Just so you know.

@rule react.h.upset_badcompany.bad
on react
when hook=upset_badcompany fit=bad
- I warned you.
- Told you. Go find somebody else.

@rule move.h.upset_badcompany.comfort
