- Okay. As long as you know.
- Fine. Stay, then.

@rule move.h.upset_badcompany.ask
on move.ask
when hook=upset_badcompany
- Ask if she wants to be left alone

@rule react.h.upset_badcompany.ask
on react
when hook=upset_badcompany move=ask fit=good|neutral
- ...No. Not really.
- Give me a minute. Then maybe.
- I don't know what I want.

@rule move.h.upset_badcompany.share
on move.share
when hook=upset_badcompany
- Admit you came just to see her

@rule react.h.upset_badcompany.share
on react
when hook=upset_badcompany move=share fit=good|neutral
- Oh. ...Okay.
- Bad timing. But okay.
- You picked a terrible day for it. Thanks.

@rule day.h.upset_event
on day
when mood=upset
hook upset_event
opens comfort,ask,invite
feel pout
- Somebody said something this morning. I can't stop thinking about it.
- Something happened at home. Leave it at that.
- Why does it always go like this? Forget it.
- Nothing I do comes out right. Never mind.

@rule react.h.upset_event.bad
on react
when hook=upset_event fit=bad
