when mood=none voice=tsundere
hook tsun_notcare
opens tease,ask,praise
feel pout
- W-why do you care? It was fine. Totally fine.
- Not that it matters to you, but fine.
- Don't think I was waiting for you.
- I was just standing here. Don't get the wrong idea.

@rule react.h.tsun_notcare.bad
