- Thank you! See? Not that hard.

@rule move.h.gyaru_look.ask
on move.ask
when hook=gyaru_look
- Ask where she gets it done

@rule react.h.gyaru_look.ask
on react
when hook=gyaru_look move=ask fit=good|neutral
