- You're just being nice. Thank you.
- Most people don't say that.

@rule move.h.shy_quiet.praise
on move.praise
when hook=shy_quiet
- Say it's nice talking to her

@rule react.h.shy_quiet.praise
on react
when hook=shy_quiet move=praise fit=good|neutral
- O-oh. Thank you.
- Y-you don't have to say that.
- ...Thank you.

@rule day.h.shy_smallwin
on day
when mood=none voice=shy|bookish
hook shy_smallwin
opens praise,ask,share
feel shy
- I said good morning to someone today. It went okay.
- I answered a question in class. My voice shook.
- I, um, talked in front of the group today. Only a little.

@rule react.h.shy_smallwin.bad
on react
when hook=shy_smallwin fit=bad
- I... I shouldn't have told you.
- O-oh. It wasn't a big thing anyway.

@rule move.h.shy_smallwin.praise
on move.praise
when hook=shy_smallwin
- Say that took courage

@rule react.h.shy_smallwin.praise
on react
when hook=shy_smallwin move=praise fit=good|neutral
- I-it was only a little thing. But thank you.
- Nobody ever says that.
- You're embarrassing me...

@rule move.h.shy_smallwin.ask
on move.ask
when hook=shy_smallwin
- Ask how it felt

@rule react.h.shy_smallwin.ask
on react
when hook=shy_smallwin move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Scary. Then okay. Then scary again.
- My hands are still cold.
- Good, I think. I'm not sure yet.

@rule move.h.shy_smallwin.share
on move.share
when hook=shy_smallwin
- Say you'd cheer her on next time

@rule react.h.shy_smallwin.share
on react
when hook=shy_smallwin move=share fit=good|neutral
- Y-you would? ...Okay.
- Please don't do it loudly.
- That might actually help.

@rule day.h.shy_cat
on day
when mood=none voice=shy|bookish
hook shy_cat
opens ask,invite,praise
feel shy
- I fed the cat behind the gym. Please don't tell anyone.
- There's a cat behind the gym. I've been feeding it. It's a secret.

@rule react.h.shy_cat.bad
on react
when hook=shy_cat fit=bad
- P-please forget about the cat.
- I shouldn't have told you about it...

@rule move.h.shy_cat.ask
on move.ask
when hook=shy_cat
- Ask about the cat

@rule react.h.shy_cat.ask
on react
when hook=shy_cat move=ask fit=good|neutral
- She's gray. I call her Tuesday.
- She lets me pet her now. It took weeks.
- She only eats the good tuna. I can't afford it.

@rule move.h.shy_cat.invite
on move.invite
when hook=shy_cat
- Ask to come see the cat with her

@rule react.h.shy_cat.invite
on react
when hook=shy_cat move=invite fit=good|neutral
- You'd want to? Okay.
- She might be scared of you. I'll introduce you.
- I'd like that. I think.

@rule move.h.shy_cat.praise
on move.praise
when hook=shy_cat
- Say that's very kind of her

@rule react.h.shy_cat.praise
on react
when hook=shy_cat move=praise fit=good|neutral
- It's nothing. She was hungry.
- D-don't tell anyone, please.
- She's the kind one. She lets me sit there.

@rule day.h.lazy_nap
on day
when mood=sleepy voice=lazy|airhead
hook lazy_nap
opens ask,tease,invite
- Zzz... huh? Oh, hi. I wasn't sleeping.
- I had a whole dream in history class. It was a good one.
- I dreamed about pudding.

@rule react.h.lazy_nap.bad
on react
when hook=lazy_nap fit=bad
- Too loud. Going back to sleep.
- Mmh... that was better in the dream.

@rule move.h.lazy_nap.ask
on move.ask
when hook=lazy_nap
- Ask what the dream was about

@rule react.h.lazy_nap.ask
on react
when hook=lazy_nap move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Pudding. Big pudding. I don't want to talk about it.
- There was a castle, I think. Then the bell.
- It's gone now. You scared it away.

@rule move.h.lazy_nap.tease
on move.tease
when hook=lazy_nap
- Say she was definitely sleeping

@rule react.h.lazy_nap.tease
on react
when hook=lazy_nap move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I was resting my eyes. Loudly.
- Prove it.
- Mmh. Your word against mine.

@rule move.h.lazy_nap.invite
on move.invite
when hook=lazy_nap
- Suggest a nap on the roof

@rule react.h.lazy_nap.invite
on react
when hook=lazy_nap move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Now that's a good plan.
- Mmh. Carry me there.
- You're the best. Wake me gently.

@rule day.h.lazy_saving
on day
when mood=sleepy voice=lazy|airhead
hook lazy_saving
opens ask,tease,invite
- I'm saving my energy. For what, I don't know.
- Moving is overrated. You go ahead.
- The sun's so warm on this desk. Mmh.

@rule react.h.lazy_saving.bad
on react
when hook=lazy_saving fit=bad
- That costs too much energy. Pass.
- Mmh. No. Goodnight.

@rule move.h.lazy_saving.ask
on move.ask
when hook=lazy_saving
- Ask when she plans to move

@rule react.h.lazy_saving.ask
on react
when hook=lazy_saving move=ask fit=good|neutral
- When the sun moves.
- Tomorrow. Or the day after.
- That's a lot of questions.

@rule move.h.lazy_saving.tease
on move.tease
when hook=lazy_saving
- Pull her chair a little

@rule react.h.lazy_saving.tease
on react
when hook=lazy_saving move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Noo. Give it back.
- You're cruel.
- Mmh. Do it again and I'll tell.

@rule move.h.lazy_saving.invite
on move.invite
when hook=lazy_saving
- Sit down next to her

@rule react.h.lazy_saving.invite
on react
when hook=lazy_saving move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Mm. You understand.
- Stay. It's warm.
- Mm. Good.

@rule day.h.lunchwith
on day
when realverb=ate_with kind=day how=participant
hook lunchwith
opens ask,tease,share
feel smile
- It was nice! We talked the whole time.
- Lunch with {who} was fun. I like eating with {who}.
- {Who} did an impression of the teacher. I almost choked.
- We got so busy talking, {who} and I, we almost missed the bell.

@rule react.h.lunchwith.bad
on react
when hook=lunchwith fit=bad
- Don't spoil a nice lunch.
- Hey, I was telling you about something nice.

@rule move.h.lunchwith.ask
on move.ask
when hook=lunchwith
- Ask what they talked about

@rule react.h.lunchwith.ask
on react
when hook=lunchwith move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Oh, nothing. Teachers, food, who likes who.
- {Who} did most of the talking. I just laughed.
- Stuff you wouldn't care about. Hehe.

@rule move.h.lunchwith.tease
on move.tease
when hook=lunchwith
- Ask if you came up

@rule react.h.lunchwith.tease
on react
when hook=lunchwith move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Maybe a little. All good things.
- Hehe. Wouldn't you like to know.
- You're very sure of yourself.

@rule move.h.lunchwith.share
on move.share
when hook=lunchwith
- Say you're glad she had a good lunch

@rule react.h.lunchwith.share
on react
when hook=lunchwith move=share fit=good|neutral
- Thanks. {Who}'s easy to be around.
- Me too. It made the day shorter.
- You should join us next time.

@rule day.h.fightwith
on day
when realverb=fought|insulted kind=day how=participant
hook fightwith
opens comfort,ask,defend
feel sad
fit comfort=good
- We had words. I'm still mad, honestly.
- {Who} and I aren't talking. Don't get me started.
- {Who} said something and I snapped. I don't even know how it started.
- I said something to {who} I can't unsay.
- {Who} walked right past me this morning. It hurts more than I thought.

@rule react.h.fightwith.bad
on react
when hook=fightwith fit=bad
- You're just making it worse.
- I knew I shouldn't have brought it up.

@rule move.h.fightwith.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=fightwith
- Say these things blow over

@rule react.h.fightwith.comfort
on react
when hook=fightwith move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- I hope so. It doesn't feel that way yet.
- Thanks. I needed someone to say it.
- Okay. That helps a bit.

@rule move.h.fightwith.ask
on move.ask
when hook=fightwith
- Ask how it started

@rule react.h.fightwith.ask
on react
when hook=fightwith move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Over nothing. That's the worst part.
- I can't even repeat it. It's too stupid.
- Something small, and then it wasn't small anymore.

@rule move.h.fightwith.defend
on move.defend
when hook=fightwith
- Say {who} probably feels bad too

@rule react.h.fightwith.defend
on react
when hook=fightwith move=defend fit=good|neutral
- Maybe. {Who} could say so, then.
- You think so? ...You might be right.
- I'll think about it. Not today.

@rule day.h.madeupwith
on day
when realverb=made_up kind=day how=participant
hook madeupwith
opens praise,ask,share
feel smile
- Yeah, we're okay now. I missed {who}.
- We talked it out, {who} and I. It feels good.
- {Who} and I made up. What a relief.
- We sat on the stairs and talked for an hour, {who} and I. I feel lighter.

@rule react.h.madeupwith.bad
on react
when hook=madeupwith fit=bad
- We just made up. Don't stir it up.
- Can't you just be glad for us?

@rule move.h.madeupwith.praise
on move.praise
when hook=madeupwith
- Say you're happy for them

@rule react.h.madeupwith.praise
on react
when hook=madeupwith move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Thanks. It was scary.
- ...Yeah. Me too.
- That means a lot.

@rule move.h.madeupwith.ask
on move.ask
when hook=madeupwith
- Ask who apologized first

@rule react.h.madeupwith.ask
on react
when hook=madeupwith move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I did. Then {who} did. Then we both cried.
- We said it at the same time, I think.
- It doesn't matter now. Hehe.

@rule move.h.madeupwith.share
on move.share
when hook=madeupwith
- Say you knew they'd be fine

@rule react.h.madeupwith.share
on react
when hook=madeupwith move=share fit=good|neutral
- You did? You could've told me.
- Don't act so smug.
- I should've listened to you.

@rule day.h.datingwith
on day
when realverb=started_dating kind=day how=participant
hook datingwith
opens tease,ask,praise
feel shy
- Y-yeah. Me and {who}. It just sort of happened.
- Um... yes. {Who} and I are going out. I'm still pinching myself.
- So, it's official. Me and {who}. Please don't tease me.
- I keep waiting for someone to say it's a joke, {who} and me.

@rule react.h.datingwith.bad
on react
when hook=datingwith fit=bad
- See, this is why I didn't want to tell anyone.
- You could at least be happy for me.

@rule move.h.datingwith.tease
on move.tease
when hook=datingwith
- Say you can see her blushing

@rule react.h.datingwith.tease
on react
when hook=datingwith move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I-I'm not! ...Am I?
- Stop it, I said don't tease!
- It's warm in here, that's all.

@rule move.h.datingwith.ask
on move.ask
when hook=datingwith
- Ask how it happened

@rule react.h.datingwith.ask
on react
when hook=datingwith move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I don't really know. We were talking, and then we weren't.
- Everyone keeps asking, and I still haven't got an answer.
- It's a long story. A short one, really.

@rule move.h.datingwith.praise
on move.praise
when hook=datingwith
- Congratulate her

@rule react.h.datingwith.praise
on react
when hook=datingwith move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Thank you. Hehe.
- I'm so happy it's a little scary.
- You're the first one who didn't scream. Thanks.

@rule day.h.rain_bookfight
on day
when kind=day placeid=library l_study=yes wet=yes fight=yes
hook rain_bookfight
opens comfort,ask
feel shy
fit comfort=good
- I came to read with the rain on the windows. It helps me forget about {fightwho}. A little.
- Rain, a book and a quiet corner. I needed it, after the fight with {fightwho}.
- I read the same page four times. {Fightwho} keeps getting in my head.
- If you came to talk about {fightwho}, I'll hide behind this book.

@rule react.h.rain_bookfight.bad
on react
when hook=rain_bookfight fit=bad
- I came here to stop thinking about that.
- Let me read. Please.

@rule move.h.rain_bookfight.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=rain_bookfight
- Say you'll just sit quietly with her

@rule react.h.rain_bookfight.comfort
on react
when hook=rain_bookfight move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...Okay. Thanks.
- That's all I wanted, I think.
- Mm. Stay as long as you like.

@rule move.h.rain_bookfight.ask
on move.ask
when hook=rain_bookfight
- Ask what she's reading

@rule react.h.rain_bookfight.ask
on react
when hook=rain_bookfight move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A mystery. It's easier than real life.
- I don't even know anymore. Thanks for asking.
- Something long. On purpose.

@rule day.h.rain_book
on day
when kind=day placeid=library l_study=yes wet=yes
hook rain_book
opens ask,share,invite
feel smile
- Perfect, actually. Rain outside, a book in here.
- I've been reading all afternoon. The rain makes it better.
- Rainy days are library days. I found the best seat by the window.
- This author writes rainy scenes so well. It's like being inside the book.

@rule react.h.rain_book.bad
on react
when hook=rain_book fit=bad
- You're louder than the rain. Shh.
- I'd like to get back to my book now.

@rule move.h.rain_book.ask
on move.ask
when hook=rain_book
- Ask what she's reading

@rule react.h.rain_book.ask
on react
when hook=rain_book move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A mystery. I'm halfway and I suspect everyone.
- It's good. Don't ask me the ending.
- Something with a lot of rain in it. Fitting.

@rule move.h.rain_book.share
on move.share
when hook=rain_book
- Say the rain is good for reading

@rule react.h.rain_book.share
on react
when hook=rain_book move=share fit=good|neutral
- Right? Finally someone gets it.
- You should try it. I can lend you one.
- There's no better day for it.

@rule move.h.rain_book.invite
on move.invite
when hook=rain_book
- Ask to sit with her

@rule react.h.rain_book.invite
on react
when hook=rain_book move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Sure. Just don't talk too loud.
- Here. The window seat's the best one.
- Okay. I won't bite. I'll just read.

@rule day.h.rain_lover
on day
when kind=day wet=yes rainlover=yes
hook rain_lover
opens ask,share,invite
feel smile
- Great! It's raining! Best day this week.
- Rainy days make me happy. I can't explain it.
- I walked here the long way, in the rain. On purpose.
- I wish it rained every day. Listen to that sound.

@rule react.h.rain_lover.bad
on react
when hook=rain_lover fit=bad
- You can't ruin the rain for me. But you're trying.
- I'll go listen to the rain instead.

@rule move.h.rain_lover.ask
on move.ask
when hook=rain_lover
- Ask what she likes about the rain

@rule react.h.rain_lover.ask
on react
when hook=rain_lover move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The sound. The smell. Everything goes quiet.
- Everyone hides, and it's all mine.
- I can't explain it. It's just nice.

@rule move.h.rain_lover.share
on move.share
when hook=rain_lover
- Say you like the sound of it too

@rule react.h.rain_lover.share
on react
when hook=rain_lover move=share fit=good|neutral
- See? You get it!
- I knew you were one of us.
- Good. Most people just complain.

@rule move.h.rain_lover.invite
on move.invite
when hook=rain_lover
- Suggest going to look at it together

@rule react.h.rain_lover.invite
on react
when hook=rain_lover move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes! Just one minute. You won't melt.
- Come on, the good spot's by the stairs.
- I thought you'd never ask.

@rule day.h.rain_cooped
on day
when kind=day wet=yes tone=energetic
hook rain_cooped
opens ask,tease,invite
feel pout
- Terrible! It's raining! I wanted to run!
- Practice got moved inside, so now we're all squashed in the gym.
- I'm SO bored. Rain means no going outside.
- I can't be inside this long! This building's too small for me today!

@rule react.h.rain_cooped.bad
on react
when hook=rain_cooped fit=bad
- As if being stuck in here wasn't bad enough!
- I'm already climbing the walls. Don't.

@rule move.h.rain_cooped.ask
on move.ask
when hook=rain_cooped
- Ask how long it's supposed to last

@rule react.h.rain_cooped.ask
on react
when hook=rain_cooped move=ask fit=good|neutral
- All day! All day! Can you believe it?!
- Too long! I checked three times!
- Don't ask! It only gets worse!

@rule move.h.rain_cooped.tease
on move.tease
when hook=rain_cooped
- Say she looks like a caged animal

@rule react.h.rain_cooped.tease
on react
when hook=rain_cooped move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I feel like one! Let me out!
- Grr! That's how I feel!
- Ha! Open the cage, then!

@rule move.h.rain_cooped.invite
on move.invite
when hook=rain_cooped
- Suggest playing something indoors

@rule react.h.rain_cooped.invite
on react
when hook=rain_cooped move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Anything! I'm dying here!
- Yes! Let's go! Now!
- You're my hero! Race you to the gym!

@rule day.h.rain_soft
on day
when kind=day wet=yes tone=gentle
hook rain_soft
opens share,ask,invite
feel smile
- It's been a slow day... the rain makes everything soft.
- Quiet. I like rainy days, a little.
- I've been watching the rain from the window. It's peaceful.
- Everyone's voices sound softer today. The school's so quiet in the rain.

@rule react.h.rain_soft.bad
on react
when hook=rain_soft fit=bad
- It was such a peaceful day, too.
- I think I'll go back to my window.

@rule move.h.rain_soft.share
on move.share
when hook=rain_soft
- Say it's a nice sound to listen to

@rule react.h.rain_soft.share
on react
when hook=rain_soft move=share fit=good|neutral
- Isn't it? I could fall asleep.
- It is. I'm glad you think so too.
- Mm. It makes me want to drink tea.

@rule move.h.rain_soft.ask
on move.ask
when hook=rain_soft
- Ask if she likes rainy days

@rule react.h.rain_soft.ask
on react
when hook=rain_soft move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A little. They make the day feel smaller, in a good way.
- I do. I hope it doesn't stop yet.
- Mm. When I'm indoors, anyway.

@rule move.h.rain_soft.invite
on move.invite
when hook=rain_soft
- Offer to stay and watch it with her

@rule react.h.rain_soft.invite
on react
when hook=rain_soft move=invite fit=good|neutral
- If you're not busy. I'd like that.
- There's no hurry on a day like this.
- Sit with me, then.

@rule day.h.rain_cool
on day
when kind=day wet=yes tone=cool
hook rain_cool
opens share,ask
- Fine. Fewer people outside. Good.
- It's raining. The halls are packed. Not ideal.
- People get loud when they can't go out.
- The cafeteria's unbearable on days like this.

@rule react.h.rain_cool.bad
on react
when hook=rain_cool fit=bad
- And now you're adding to the noise.
- Another reason to stay away from people today.

@rule move.h.rain_cool.share
on move.share
when hook=rain_cool
- Say the crowds get to you too

@rule react.h.rain_cool.share
on react
when hook=rain_cool move=share fit=good|neutral
- So you do have sense.
- Then we agree.
- Hm. Nobody asked, but yes.

@rule move.h.rain_cool.ask
on move.ask
when hook=rain_cool
- Ask where she goes to get away

@rule react.h.rain_cool.ask
on react
when hook=rain_cool move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Somewhere quiet. I won't say where.
- The stairs behind the gym. Don't tell anyone.
- Anywhere the others aren't.

@rule day.h.rain_tease
on day
when kind=day wet=yes tone=teasing
hook rain_tease
opens tease,invite
feel smile
- Rainy and boring. Until now~
- Wet. Dull. But you showed up.
- Rain all day. I was hoping someone would rescue me.
- I'm stuck inside and bored. Do something about it.

@rule react.h.rain_tease.bad
on react
when hook=rain_tease fit=bad
- I was hoping for a better rescue.
- Hm. I was better off bored.

@rule move.h.rain_tease.tease
on move.tease
when hook=rain_tease
- Ask what kind of rescue she has in mind

@rule react.h.rain_tease.tease
on react
when hook=rain_tease move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Use your imagination.
- Hehe. You're asking too many questions.
- Something fun. Surprise me.

@rule move.h.rain_tease.invite
on move.invite
when hook=rain_tease
- Offer to keep her company

@rule react.h.rain_tease.invite
on react
when hook=rain_tease move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Lucky me.
- Mm, that's a start.
- Things are looking up.

@rule day.h.rainlater_sky
on day
when kind=day rainlater=yes
hook rainlater_sky
opens ask,share,invite
- Fine, but it looks like rain.
- Okay so far. The sky's getting dark, though.
- Everyone's talking about the rain later.
- I can smell it coming. It's going to pour.
- Look at those clouds. Any minute now.

@rule react.h.rainlater_sky.bad
on react
when hook=rainlater_sky fit=bad
- Keep that up and I'll leave before it pours.
- I'd rather watch the clouds, thanks.

@rule move.h.rainlater_sky.ask
on move.ask
when hook=rainlater_sky
- Ask if she brought an umbrella

@rule react.h.rainlater_sky.ask
on react
when hook=rainlater_sky move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Nope. I looked at the sky this morning and laughed.
- Of course not. Why would I be prepared?
- I have one. It's small, but it's mine.

@rule move.h.rainlater_sky.share
on move.share
when hook=rainlater_sky
- Say the forecast said heavy rain

@rule react.h.rainlater_sky.share
on react
when hook=rainlater_sky move=share fit=good|neutral
- Great. Just great.
- Then I'd better leave early.
- I knew it. My hair always knows.

@rule move.h.rainlater_sky.invite
on move.invite
when hook=rainlater_sky
- Offer to walk back with her before it starts

@rule react.h.rainlater_sky.invite
on react
when hook=rainlater_sky move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Good idea. Let's not wait too long.
- Sure. If you don't mind.
- Okay. What do you say to right after class?

@rule day.h.storm
on day
when kind=day weather=storm
hook storm
opens comfort,share
feel worried
fit comfort=good
- The storm's freaking me out.
- Did you hear that thunder? I jumped so high at the last one.
- The lights flickered during class. Everyone screamed.
- The windows are rattling. Is that normal?

@rule react.h.storm.bad
on react
when hook=storm fit=bad
- Not now! I can't think with all this thunder!
- You're not helping! That one was close!

@rule move.h.storm.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=storm
- Say the building is safe

@rule react.h.storm.comfort
on react
when hook=storm move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- I know. I just jumped, that's all.
- Thanks. Stay here for the next one?
- Okay. If you say so.

@rule move.h.storm.share
on move.share
when hook=storm
- Say the thunder got you too

@rule react.h.storm.share
on react
when hook=storm move=share fit=good|neutral
- So it's not just me.
- Good. I thought I was being a baby.
- Don't laugh, but that makes me feel better.

@rule day.h.fightplace
on day
when kind=day fight=yes
hook fightplace
opens comfort,ask
feel sad
fit comfort=good
- Not great. {Fightwho} and I had a fight.
- Honestly? Bad. Me and {fightwho} aren't talking.
- I've been avoiding {fightwho} all day.
- I keep replaying the fight with {fightwho}.

@rule react.h.fightplace.bad
on react
when hook=fightplace fit=bad
- You don't know what happened, so stop.
- I don't want to talk about that fight anymore.

@rule move.h.fightplace.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=fightplace
- Say she'll work it out with {fightwho}

@rule react.h.fightplace.comfort
on react
when hook=fightplace move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- I hope you're right.
- Maybe. It doesn't feel that way yet.
- Thanks.

@rule move.h.fightplace.ask
on move.ask
when hook=fightplace
- Ask how it started

@rule react.h.fightplace.ask
on react
when hook=fightplace move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Over nothing. It always is.
- Do I have to go into it? ...Okay, a little.
- I said something. {Fightwho} said something worse.

@rule day.h.t_fine
on day
when role=teacher mood=none
hook t_fine
opens ask,share,tease
- [Two classes down, three to go.|Normal so far.|The usual.] [Nobody's set anything on fire yet.|The chalk still works.|I'll take it.]
- It's a teacher's day, that's all. [Lessons, papers, more papers.|Attendance, lessons, coffee.]
- Not bad. Quiet, for once.

@rule react.h.t_fine.bad
on react
when hook=t_fine fit=bad
- Let's keep today normal, shall we?
- That's enough of that. Don't you have somewhere to be?

@rule move.h.t_fine.ask
on move.ask
when hook=t_fine
- Ask if teaching ever gets dull

@rule react.h.t_fine.ask
on react
when hook=t_fine move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Every day has one good moment. I wait for it.
- Ask me again during exam week.
- You'd be surprised what happens in a classroom.

@rule move.h.t_fine.share
on move.share
when hook=t_fine
- Say your class is behaving

@rule react.h.t_fine.share
on react
when hook=t_fine move=share fit=good|neutral
- For once. I'll believe it when I see it.
- I'm glad somebody thinks so.
- Tell your classmates that.

@rule move.h.t_fine.tease
on move.tease
when hook=t_fine
- Ask if she's going easy on homework

@rule react.h.t_fine.tease
on react
when hook=t_fine move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Nice try.
- Now that you mention it, I'll add a page.
- Not a chance.

@rule day.h.t_raise
on day
when role=teacher tcause=raise
hook t_raise
opens ask,tease,praise
feel smile
- [I shouldn't say this at school, but...|Between us?|Can you keep a secret?] [I got a raise!|My salary went up this month.|The school finally gave me a raise.]
- [You can tell, huh?|Do I look that happy?] [I just saw my new pay slip.|Let's just say the principal signed a very nice paper.]
- [Today's a good day to be a teacher.|I might actually buy myself something nice.] A raise does that.

@rule react.h.t_raise.bad
on react
when hook=t_raise fit=bad
- I'll pretend I never told you.
- Keep that up and I'll regret telling you.

@rule move.h.t_raise.ask
on move.ask
when hook=t_raise
- Ask what she'll do with the money

@rule react.h.t_raise.ask
on react
when hook=t_raise move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Something nice. Something I don't need.
- A real dinner, for once.
- Pay my rent, like an adult. And then shoes.

@rule move.h.t_raise.tease
on move.tease
when hook=t_raise
- Say she can treat the class now

@rule react.h.t_raise.tease
on react
when hook=t_raise move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Not on your life.
- The class gets a smile, and that's it.
- You're bold, for a student.

@rule move.h.t_raise.praise
on move.praise
when hook=t_raise
- Say she earned it

@rule react.h.t_raise.praise
on react
when hook=t_raise move=praise fit=good|neutral
- I did, didn't I? Thank you.
- You're sweet. Don't tell the others.
- Finally, someone agrees with me.

@rule day.h.t_results
on day
when role=teacher tcause=results
hook t_results
opens ask,praise,share
feel smile
- [My class's test results came in.|The averages are in.] [They actually listened to me!|Best scores I've had all year.]
- [You know what makes a teacher happy?|I'm so proud today.] [Good grades, that's what.|Even my worst student passed.]
- [I graded the last test this morning.|All that nagging paid off.] [Everyone passed!|I could cry. A happy cry.]

@rule react.h.t_results.bad
on react
when hook=t_results fit=bad
- Don't spoil the best day of my term.
- You could try that attitude on your own grades.

@rule move.h.t_results.ask
on move.ask
when hook=t_results
- Ask how the class did

@rule react.h.t_results.ask
on react
when hook=t_results move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Better than I dared to hope.
- The average went up by ten points. Ten!
- Everyone passed. I checked twice.

@rule move.h.t_results.praise
on move.praise
when hook=t_results
- Say she taught them well

@rule react.h.t_results.praise
on react
when hook=t_results move=praise fit=good|neutral
- It's their work. But thank you.
- You're making me blush, you know.
- That's the nicest thing a student can say.

@rule move.h.t_results.share
on move.share
when hook=t_results
- Say the class worked hard

@rule react.h.t_results.share
on react
when hook=t_results move=share fit=good|neutral
- They did, and I'm proud of them.
- Including you? I hope so.
- I know. Don't tell them, they'll get lazy.

@rule day.h.t_praise
on day
when role=teacher tcause=praise
hook t_praise
opens ask,tease,praise
feel smile
- [The principal stopped me in the hall.|I got called to the principal's office.] [Praise, for once!|He said my class is the best in the year.]
- [Someone important noticed my work.|It's nice to be told you're doing well.] [Don't laugh.|At my age, too.]
- I've been floating since this morning. The principal said something nice. [That never happens.|Enjoy it while it lasts.]

@rule react.h.t_praise.bad
on react
when hook=t_praise fit=bad
- Thanks for bringing me back to earth.
- It was nice while it lasted.

@rule move.h.t_praise.ask
on move.ask
when hook=t_praise
- Ask what the principal said

@rule react.h.t_praise.ask
on react
when hook=t_praise move=ask fit=good|neutral
- That my class is the best in the year. I asked him to repeat it.
- Something about dedication. I stopped hearing after "excellent."
- Things I'll be telling my mother tonight.

@rule move.h.t_praise.tease
on move.tease
when hook=t_praise
- Ask what she paid the principal

@rule react.h.t_praise.tease
on react
when hook=t_praise move=tease fit=good|neutral
- How dare you. Nothing. Much.
- Are you trying to ruin my day?
- That's extra homework. ...Kidding.

@rule move.h.t_praise.praise
on move.praise
when hook=t_praise
- Say the principal is right

@rule react.h.t_praise.praise
on react
when hook=t_praise move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Oh, stop. No, go on.
- Thank you. That means more from a student.
- Well. I won't argue with both of you.

@rule day.h.t_grading_sleepy
on day
when role=teacher tcause=grading mood=sleepy
hook t_grading_sleepy
opens comfort,ask,tease
feel sad
- [I was up until three grading exams.|I didn't sleep.] [The red pen is still in my hand.|Forty papers, and half of them blank.|I saw the sunrise from my desk.]
- [Mmh... sorry, I'm half asleep.|Don't mind the yawning.] [I corrected tests all night.|Grading took all night.]
- Who writes essays in that handwriting? [I read the same answer thirty times.|I graded until morning.]

@rule react.h.t_grading_sleepy.bad
on react
when hook=t_grading_sleepy fit=bad
- I've been reading nonsense all night. I can't take more.
- Not today. I'm too tired to be polite.

@rule move.h.t_grading_sleepy.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=t_grading_sleepy
- Tell her she works too hard

@rule react.h.t_grading_sleepy.comfort
on react
when hook=t_grading_sleepy move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Tell that to the stack on my desk. Thank you, though.
- Someone has to read them. But thank you.
- You're a good kid.

@rule move.h.t_grading_sleepy.ask
on move.ask
when hook=t_grading_sleepy
- Ask how many exams are left

@rule react.h.t_grading_sleepy.ask
on react
when hook=t_grading_sleepy move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Don't ask. I'll cry in front of a student.
- Fewer than last night. That's all I can say.
- Enough to keep me up again.

@rule move.h.t_grading_sleepy.tease
on move.tease
when hook=t_grading_sleepy
- Ask if you passed

@rule react.h.t_grading_sleepy.tease
on react
when hook=t_grading_sleepy move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Nice try. You'll know when everyone knows.
- Keep that up and you won't.
- I'm too tired to lie, so I won't answer.

@rule day.h.t_grading_stressed
on day
when role=teacher tcause=grading mood=stressed
hook t_grading_stressed
opens comfort,ask,share
feel worried
- [I have a mountain of exams on my desk.|The grades are due and I'm not even halfway.] [Please don't ask me for anything.|I can see them when I close my eyes.]
- [Grading, grading, grading.|There aren't enough hours for all these tests.] [I'll be fine. Probably.|The deadline is tomorrow.]
- [If one more student asks about their score...|I still have two classes' worth of papers.] [Sorry. It's not you.|Give me strength.]

@rule react.h.t_grading_stressed.bad
on react
when hook=t_grading_stressed fit=bad
- Do you see these papers? Not now.
- I have no time for this.

@rule move.h.t_grading_stressed.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=t_grading_stressed
- Tell her she works too hard

@rule react.h.t_grading_stressed.comfort
on react
when hook=t_grading_stressed move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Now the student is worrying about the teacher. Thank you.
- I needed to hear that today.
- It's the job. But it's nice of you to say.

@rule move.h.t_grading_stressed.ask
on move.ask
when hook=t_grading_stressed
- Ask when the grades are due

@rule react.h.t_grading_stressed.ask
on react
when hook=t_grading_stressed move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Tomorrow. I'm trying not to think about it.
- Sooner than I can manage.
- Don't remind me.

@rule move.h.t_grading_stressed.share
on move.share
when hook=t_grading_stressed
- Say the class hopes she gets some rest

@rule react.h.t_grading_stressed.share
on react
when hook=t_grading_stressed move=share fit=good|neutral
- Do they? That's kind of them.
- They could start by writing more clearly.
- Thank you. Tell them to stop asking about scores.

@rule day.h.t_lessons
on day
when role=teacher tcause=lessons
hook t_lessons
opens comfort,ask,tease
feel sad
- [I rewrote my lesson plan until dawn.|Tomorrow's lesson kept me up.] [It still isn't good.|Nobody warns you about this part of the job.]
- [Mmh... lesson plans.|I fell asleep on my notes.] [I have ink on my face, don't I?|Don't tell the class.]
- I kept thinking of a better way to explain it. [At three in the morning.|Sleep didn't stand a chance.]

@rule react.h.t_lessons.bad
on react
when hook=t_lessons fit=bad
- I gave that lesson my whole night. Let it go.
- Save it until I've slept.

@rule move.h.t_lessons.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=t_lessons
- Say her lessons are good already

@rule react.h.t_lessons.comfort
on react
when hook=t_lessons move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- You really think so? You're not just saying it?
- I needed that. Thank you.
- Then why do half of you sleep through them? ...Thank you.

@rule move.h.t_lessons.ask
on move.ask
when hook=t_lessons
- Ask what tomorrow's lesson is about

@rule react.h.t_lessons.ask
on react
when hook=t_lessons move=ask fit=good|neutral
- You'll find out. If I survive.
- Something I've explained four different ways now.
- You should know. It's on the schedule.

@rule move.h.t_lessons.tease
on move.tease
when hook=t_lessons
- Say you'll sleep through it anyway

@rule react.h.t_lessons.tease
on react
when hook=t_lessons move=tease fit=good|neutral
- You will not. I'll call on you first.
- After all that work? I'll remember this.
- Try it and see.

@rule day.h.t_staffparty
on day
when role=teacher tcause=staffparty
hook t_staffparty
opens tease,ask,comfort
feel sad
- [Quietly, please.|Not so loud.] [The staff party went late.|The vice principal kept pouring.]
- [Teachers can't say no to the principal's drink.|The other teachers dragged me out last night.] [My head hurts.|Don't tell the students.]
- Forget anything you think you know about teachers. Last night's staff party happened.

@rule react.h.t_staffparty.bad
on react
when hook=t_staffparty fit=bad
- Not so loud. And not that.
- My head can't take this. Go.

@rule move.h.t_staffparty.tease
on move.tease
when hook=t_staffparty
- Ask what the vice principal sang

@rule react.h.t_staffparty.tease
on react
when hook=t_staffparty move=tease fit=good|neutral
- We don't speak of that.
- Who told you there was singing?
- You'll never know. None of you will.

@rule move.h.t_staffparty.ask
on move.ask
when hook=t_staffparty
- Ask how late it went

@rule react.h.t_staffparty.ask
on react
when hook=t_staffparty move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The last train. I think.
- Too late for a school night.
- I remember dessert. After that, no.

@rule move.h.t_staffparty.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=t_staffparty
- Offer to get her some water

@rule react.h.t_staffparty.comfort
on react
when hook=t_staffparty move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- You're an angel. Quietly, please.
- Yes. Thank you. Don't tell anyone.
- Good student. Very good student.

@rule day.h.t_parents
on day
when role=teacher tcause=parents
hook t_parents
opens comfort,ask,share
feel worried
- [Parent meetings all week.|I had three parents in a row today.] [Everyone's child is a genius, apparently.|Smile, nod, repeat.]
- Being polite to parents for an hour is exhausting. I need a quiet room.
- [One mother called me at home.|I've been on the phone with parents since morning.] [At home!|About a B-plus.]

@rule react.h.t_parents.bad
on react
when hook=t_parents fit=bad
- I've been polite for hours. Don't test it.
- I have no patience left today.

@rule move.h.t_parents.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=t_parents
- Say that sounds exhausting

@rule react.h.t_parents.comfort
on react
when hook=t_parents move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- It is. Thank you for noticing.
- You have no idea. But thank you.
- I'll survive. Teachers always do.

@rule move.h.t_parents.ask
on move.ask
when hook=t_parents
- Ask what the parents want

@rule react.h.t_parents.ask
on react
when hook=t_parents move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Higher grades, without the studying.
- To hear their child is a genius.
- Everything, and by Friday.

@rule move.h.t_parents.share
on move.share
when hook=t_parents
- Say your parents would be just as bad

@rule react.h.t_parents.share
on react
when hook=t_parents move=share fit=good|neutral
- I know. I've met them.
- Then I'm glad I've got you, not them.
- Don't tell them I said so, but yes.

@rule day.h.t_principal
on day
when role=teacher tcause=principal
hook t_principal
opens comfort,ask,share
feel worried
- [The principal wants the report by Friday.|The principal has been on my back all day.] [As if I had nothing else to do.|I can't say what I think of that.]
- [Another meeting about the budget.|Another form from the principal's office.] [We have less chalk than ambition.|I became a teacher to teach.]
- If I look tense, it's the principal. Don't repeat that.

@rule react.h.t_principal.bad
on react
when hook=t_principal fit=bad
- Please. I get enough of that from the principal.
- I've had my fill of that today.

@rule move.h.t_principal.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=t_principal
- Say the principal should leave her alone

@rule react.h.t_principal.comfort
on react
when hook=t_principal move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- I wish you could tell him. Thank you.
- Careful. But thank you.
- You're on my side? That's something.

@rule move.h.t_principal.ask
on move.ask
when hook=t_principal
- Ask what the principal wants

@rule react.h.t_principal.ask
on react
when hook=t_principal move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A report nobody will read.
- More paper, less chalk.
- You'll see when you grow up.

@rule move.h.t_principal.share
on move.share
when hook=t_principal
- Say you won't repeat anything

@rule react.h.t_principal.share
on react
when hook=t_principal move=share fit=good|neutral
- Good. I knew I could trust you.
- Thank you. I shouldn't have said that.
- Our secret.

@rule day.h.t_complaint
on day
when role=teacher tcause=complaint
hook t_complaint
opens comfort,ask,share
feel sad
- [A parent complained about me.|Someone went to the principal about my class.] [After everything I do for those kids.|I had to apologize. Me.]
- A complaint came in about me. One complaint undoes a year of work.
- [Teachers aren't supposed to look upset.|I'm keeping it together, more or less.] [That complaint hurt.|I'll be professional tomorrow.]

@rule react.h.t_complaint.bad
on react
when hook=t_complaint fit=bad
- Would you like to file one too?
- That's what I get for opening up at school.

@rule move.h.t_complaint.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=t_complaint
- Say she's a good teacher

@rule react.h.t_complaint.comfort
on react
when hook=t_complaint move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Thank you. I needed to hear that today.
- You're kinder than I expected.
- From a student, that counts for more.

@rule move.h.t_complaint.ask
on move.ask
when hook=t_complaint
- Ask what the complaint was about

@rule react.h.t_complaint.ask
on react
when hook=t_complaint move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I shouldn't say. It wasn't fair, though.
- A grade. It's always a grade.
- It doesn't matter. It hurt, that's all.

@rule move.h.t_complaint.share
on move.share
when hook=t_complaint
- Say the class is on her side

@rule react.h.t_complaint.share
on react
when hook=t_complaint move=share fit=good|neutral
- Is it? That helps.
- Don't tell them I was upset.
- Thank you. I'll try to believe it.

@rule day.h.t_ignored
on day
when role=teacher tcause=ignored
hook t_ignored
opens comfort,ask,tease
feel sad
- [I talked to the wall for fifty minutes.|Nobody listened to a word today.] [My class doesn't care.|Half of them were asleep.]
- [I confiscated three phones today.|I explained it twice to a room of phones.] I'm tired of being the bad guy.
- Sometimes I wonder if any of it sticks. Do you actually listen in class?

@rule react.h.t_ignored.bad
on react
when hook=t_ignored fit=bad
- Now I know you don't listen either.
- And you wonder why I'm tired.

@rule move.h.t_ignored.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=t_ignored
- Say you listen in her class

@rule react.h.t_ignored.comfort
on react
when hook=t_ignored move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Do you? ...Thank you. I needed someone to say yes.
- I'll test that, you know. But thank you.
- You're a good kid.

@rule move.h.t_ignored.ask
on move.ask
when hook=t_ignored
- Ask what class it was

@rule react.h.t_ignored.ask
on react
when hook=t_ignored move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Yours, partly. Don't look so innocent.
- The one after lunch. It's always that one.
- I won't say. They know who they are.

@rule move.h.t_ignored.tease
on move.tease
when hook=t_ignored
- Say you were one of the sleeping ones

@rule react.h.t_ignored.tease
on react
when hook=t_ignored move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I know. I saw you.
- Is that supposed to help?
- Extra homework. For honesty.

@rule day.h.t_meeting
on day
when role=teacher tcause=meeting
hook t_meeting
opens ask,tease,invite
- [Two hours of staff meeting.|The staff meeting went on forever.] [About the color of the new folders.|I drew a whole cat in my notes.]
- [I've been counting ceiling tiles in the staff meeting.|If I have to hear "as discussed" one more time...] Rescue me.
- Nothing happens in the staff room but meetings. Say something interesting.

@rule react.h.t_meeting.bad
on react
when hook=t_meeting fit=bad
- That was somehow worse than the meeting.
- I'd rather go back to the meeting.

@rule move.h.t_meeting.ask
on move.ask
when hook=t_meeting
- Ask what the meeting was about

@rule react.h.t_meeting.ask
on react
when hook=t_meeting move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Folders. Two hours of folders.
- The word "synergy" came up nine times.
- I couldn't tell you. I drew a cat.

@rule move.h.t_meeting.tease
on move.tease
when hook=t_meeting
- Say teachers have it easy

@rule react.h.t_meeting.tease
on react
when hook=t_meeting move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Sit in on one. I dare you.
- You'd beg for an exam instead.
- Oh, you'll pay for that.

@rule move.h.t_meeting.invite
on move.invite
when hook=t_meeting
- Offer to bring her a coffee

@rule react.h.t_meeting.invite
on react
when hook=t_meeting move=invite fit=good|neutral
- You're my favorite student. Don't tell anyone.
- Yes. Please. Black.
- Now that's the kind of initiative I like.

@rule day.h.t_staffroom
on day
when role=teacher tcause=staffroom
hook t_staffroom
opens ask,comfort,invite
feel sad
- [The staff room is empty at this hour.|Everyone went home already.] [You get used to it.|It's quiet in there.]
- [Teachers eat lunch alone a lot, you know.|Students have each other. We have marking.] [It's fine.|Don't feel sorry for me.]
- It's nice that you came to talk. Nobody talks to a teacher unless they need something.

@rule react.h.t_staffroom.bad
on react
when hook=t_staffroom fit=bad
- I shouldn't have said that to you.
- Go on, then. I have marking to do.

@rule move.h.t_staffroom.ask
on move.ask
when hook=t_staffroom
- Ask if she eats alone every day

@rule react.h.t_staffroom.ask
on react
when hook=t_staffroom move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Most days. It's fine.
- Only when the others are busy. So, most days.
- You're a nosy student. Yes.

@rule move.h.t_staffroom.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=t_staffroom
- Say you like talking to her

@rule react.h.t_staffroom.comfort
on react
when hook=t_staffroom move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Thank you. That's kind.
- You don't need anything? Really?
- That's nice to hear.

@rule move.h.t_staffroom.invite
on move.invite
when hook=t_staffroom
- Offer to keep her company for a bit

@rule react.h.t_staffroom.invite
on react
when hook=t_staffroom move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Just for a bit, then. Thank you.
- A teacher shouldn't need that. ...Stay.
- I'd like that. Don't tell the others.

@rule day.h.t_nolunch
on day
when role=teacher tcause=nolunch
hook t_nolunch
opens ask,tease,invite
- [I worked through lunch.|I skipped lunch to finish these papers.] [My stomach is louder than my class.|Don't be like me.]
- I've had coffee and half a sandwich since morning. A teacher's diet.
- I can't teach on an empty stomach. Next period is going to be rough.

@rule react.h.t_nolunch.bad
on react
when hook=t_nolunch fit=bad
- I don't have the energy for this.
- Not on an empty stomach, please.

@rule move.h.t_nolunch.ask
on move.ask
when hook=t_nolunch
- Ask when she last ate

@rule react.h.t_nolunch.ask
on react
when hook=t_nolunch move=ask fit=good|neutral
- This morning? I think that was today.
- Half a sandwich counts, doesn't it?
- Don't ask. It's embarrassing.

@rule move.h.t_nolunch.tease
on move.tease
when hook=t_nolunch
- Say she'd pass you for a rice ball

@rule react.h.t_nolunch.tease
on react
when hook=t_nolunch move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Careful. I might. Kidding.
- That's bribery. How big is the rice ball?
- Don't tempt me.

@rule move.h.t_nolunch.invite
on move.invite
when hook=t_nolunch
- Offer to get her something from the store

@rule react.h.t_nolunch.invite
on react
when hook=t_nolunch move=invite fit=good|neutral
- You'd do that? You're a lifesaver.
- Anything. I'm not picky today.
- Thank you. Don't tell the class.

@rule day.h.t_playful
on day
when role=teacher mood=flirty
hook t_playful
opens tease,ask,praise
feel smile
- I'm in a strange mood today. Must be the weather.
- I let my mind wander during a lesson today. Don't tell anyone.
- Mm, I should be working. I can't seem to take anything seriously today.

@rule react.h.t_playful.bad
on react
when hook=t_playful fit=bad
- And the mood's gone. Back to work.
- I should be taking things seriously. Thank you for the reminder.

@rule move.h.t_playful.tease
on move.tease
when hook=t_playful
- Say she seems distracted, sensei

@rule react.h.t_playful.tease
on react
when hook=t_playful move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Do I? Pay attention to your own work.
- You're very observant, for someone who sleeps in class.
- Caught me. Don't spread it around.

@rule move.h.t_playful.ask
on move.ask
when hook=t_playful
- Ask what she was thinking about

@rule react.h.t_playful.ask
on react
when hook=t_playful move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Lunch. The weekend. A holiday I'll never take.
- That's not for students to know.
- Nothing that would be on the test.

@rule move.h.t_playful.praise
on move.praise
when hook=t_playful
- Say the good mood suits her

@rule react.h.t_playful.praise
on react
when hook=t_playful move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Why, thank you. Flattery won't change your grade.
- Hehe. It won't last, so enjoy it.
- Ahem. Thank you.

@rule day.h.bday_today
on day
when mood=none|cheerful birthday=today
hook bday_today
opens praise,ask,invite
feel smile
- It's my birthday today, actually. You're one of the few who asked.
- Today's my birthday. So far it's been a pretty good one.
- Nothing much... except it's my birthday. Just saying.
- It's my birthday! I've been in a good mood since this morning.

@rule react.h.bday_today.bad
on react
when hook=bday_today fit=bad
- Wow. Even on my birthday, huh.
- Forget it. I didn't tell you so you'd say that.

@rule move.h.bday_today.praise
on move.praise
when hook=bday_today
- Wish her a happy birthday

@rule react.h.bday_today.praise
on react
when hook=bday_today move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Thank you! Say it again, I don't mind.
- Hehe. That made it a better one.
- Thanks. I'll remember you said it first.

@rule move.h.bday_today.ask
on move.ask
when hook=bday_today
- Ask what she wants for her birthday

@rule react.h.bday_today.ask
on react
when hook=bday_today move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A whole day where nobody asks me for anything.
- Cake. Obviously cake.
- You're asking? Then I'll think about it properly.

@rule move.h.bday_today.invite
on move.invite
when hook=bday_today
- Offer to treat her to something sweet

@rule react.h.bday_today.invite
on react
when hook=bday_today move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Really? Then I'm picking the biggest one.
- You'd better not be joking.
- Okay! That's my present, then.

@rule day.h.bday_week
on day
when mood=none|cheerful birthday=week
hook bday_week
opens ask,praise,tease
feel smile
- My birthday's this month. I've been counting the days.
- I'm a little excited, my birthday is coming up.
- It's almost my birthday. Don't tell anyone, I'll get embarrassed.

@rule react.h.bday_week.bad
on react
when hook=bday_week fit=bad
- Okay, I'll stop talking about my birthday.
- That's not what you say to someone whose birthday is coming.

@rule move.h.bday_week.ask
on move.ask
when hook=bday_week
- Ask what day it is

@rule react.h.bday_week.ask
on react
when hook=bday_week move=ask fit=good|neutral
- You have to guess. It's more fun that way.
- Soon. That's all you get.
- I'll tell you if you promise to remember it.

@rule move.h.bday_week.praise
on move.praise
when hook=bday_week
- Say she should celebrate big

@rule react.h.bday_week.praise
on react
when hook=bday_week move=praise fit=good|neutral
- You think so? Maybe I will.
- Big, huh. I like the sound of that.
- Okay, but you have to come.

@rule move.h.bday_week.tease
on move.tease
when hook=bday_week
- Say she's acting like a kid about it

@rule react.h.bday_week.tease
on react
when hook=bday_week move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Birthdays are allowed to be exciting!
- So? You're just jealous.
- Kids get cake. I'm fine with that.

@rule day.h.newface
on day
when role=student mood=none days=few rel=stranger|acquaintance
hook newface
opens ask,share,tease
feel shy
- It's been okay. I'm still not used to you asking, though.
- Fine, I guess. We don't really talk much, huh.
- Normal. It's a little strange telling you about my day.
- Not bad. You're... easier to talk to than I thought.

@rule react.h.newface.bad
on react
when hook=newface fit=bad
- See, this is why I don't know what to say to you.
- I'll go back to keeping my day to myself, then.

@rule move.h.newface.ask
on move.ask
when hook=newface
- Ask what she'd usually be doing right now

@rule react.h.newface.ask
on react
when hook=newface move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Probably sitting with my friends. Or reading.
- Nothing interesting. You're not missing much.
- Wondering who the person talking to me is.

@rule move.h.newface.share
on move.share
when hook=newface
- Say you'd like to know her better

@rule react.h.newface.share
on react
when hook=newface move=share fit=good|neutral
- Oh. Okay... we can start with today, then.
- You're pretty direct. It's not bad.
- Slowly, maybe. I'm not used to it.

@rule move.h.newface.tease
on move.tease
when hook=newface
- Say she looks nervous

@rule react.h.newface.tease
on react
when hook=newface move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I'm not! ...A little.
- You'd be too, if you were me.
- Stop pointing it out, that makes it worse.

@rule day.h.regular
on day
when mood=none days=many rel=friend|lover|girlfriend
hook regular
opens ask,share,tease
feel smile
- Good. You ask me every day, you know. I've started looking forward to it.
- Same as usual. Now I tell you about it, so it feels less boring.
- Fine. I was waiting for you to ask, actually.
- Better than yesterday. You'll want the details, I know.

@rule react.h.regular.bad
on react
when hook=regular fit=bad
- You ask every day just to say that?
- Some days I wish you'd just listen.

@rule move.h.regular.ask
on move.ask
when hook=regular
- Ask what was different from yesterday

@rule react.h.regular.ask
on react
when hook=regular move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The weather. And I sat by the window. Big changes.
- Nothing. That's why I need you to make it interesting.
- I didn't fall asleep in class. That's a first.

@rule move.h.regular.share
on move.share
when hook=regular
- Say talking to her is the best part of your day

@rule react.h.regular.share
on react
when hook=regular move=share fit=good|neutral
- ...Really? That's a lot to say all of a sudden.
- Me too, if I'm honest.
- Don't say that so easily. I'll believe it.

@rule move.h.regular.tease
on move.tease
when hook=regular
- Say she must be keeping a diary for you

@rule react.h.regular.tease
on react
when hook=regular move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Maybe I am. Don't read it.
- If I did, you'd be in it a lot.
- You wish.

@rule day.h.sunny_out
on day
when mood=none|cheerful weather=clear outside=yes
hook sunny_out
opens share,invite,tease
feel smile
- Look at this sky. I don't want to go back inside.
- Great, honestly. It's too nice out to be in a bad mood.
- The sun's out, so I'm happy. It's that simple.
- It's warm today. I've been outside every chance I got.

@rule react.h.sunny_out.bad
on react
when hook=sunny_out fit=bad
- Don't ruin a nice day like this.
- Hey, I was enjoying the sun.

@rule move.h.sunny_out.share
on move.share
when hook=sunny_out
- Say you came out here for the sun too

@rule react.h.sunny_out.share
on react
when hook=sunny_out move=share fit=good|neutral
- Then we've got the same idea.
- Good. Sit for a while, it's nice.
- Everyone should, on a day like this.

@rule move.h.sunny_out.invite
on move.invite
when hook=sunny_out
- Ask if she wants to walk around a bit

@rule react.h.sunny_out.invite
on react
when hook=sunny_out move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Sure. Somewhere with shade, though.
- Yes. Let's not waste it.
- Okay! Lead the way.

@rule move.h.sunny_out.tease
on move.tease
when hook=sunny_out
- Say she looks like a cat in the sun

@rule react.h.sunny_out.tease
on react
when hook=sunny_out move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Cats have the right idea.
- Don't. I'm comfortable.
- Meow. Happy now?

@rule day.h.cloudy_bored
on day
when mood=bored weather=cloudy
hook cloudy_bored
opens ask,share,invite
fit tease=neutral
- The sky's gray, the classes are gray, everything's gray.
- It looks like it wants to rain and won't. That's my mood exactly.
- Cloudy all day. Nothing's happening, not even the weather.

@rule react.h.cloudy_bored.bad
on react
when hook=cloudy_bored fit=bad
- That's even grayer than the sky.
- You're not helping.

@rule move.h.cloudy_bored.ask
on move.ask
when hook=cloudy_bored
- Ask what would fix her day

@rule react.h.cloudy_bored.ask
on react
when hook=cloudy_bored move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Sun. Or anything happening at all.
- Something sweet, probably.
- I don't know. Surprise me.

@rule move.h.cloudy_bored.share
on move.share
when hook=cloudy_bored
- Say gray days make you sleepy too

@rule react.h.cloudy_bored.share
on react
when hook=cloudy_bored move=share fit=good|neutral
- Right? I could nap right here.
- So we're both useless today.
- At least I'm not alone.

@rule move.h.cloudy_bored.invite
on move.invite
when hook=cloudy_bored
- Offer to go find something to do

@rule react.h.cloudy_bored.invite
on react
when hook=cloudy_bored move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Anything's better than this. Okay.
- Fine, but it has to be fun.
- You'd better have an idea.

@rule day.h.sports_wiped
on day
when role=student mood=sleepy clubkind=sports period=after|club
hook sports_wiped
opens ask,praise,tease
fit tease=neutral praise=good
- Practice wiped me out. I can barely keep my eyes open.
- The {club} ran us into the ground today. I'm done.
- My legs are jelly. The {club} was brutal.
- Practice was long. If I sit down, I'll fall asleep.

@rule react.h.sports_wiped.bad
on react
when hook=sports_wiped fit=bad
- I don't have the energy for that.
- Not now. I can barely stand.

@rule move.h.sports_wiped.ask
on move.ask
when hook=sports_wiped
- Ask what they made her do

@rule react.h.sports_wiped.ask
on react
when hook=sports_wiped move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Laps. And then more laps.
- Drills until nobody could talk.
- The usual, but twice. Don't ask why.

@rule move.h.sports_wiped.praise
on move.praise
when hook=sports_wiped
- Say she works harder than anyone

@rule react.h.sports_wiped.praise
on react
when hook=sports_wiped move=praise fit=good|neutral
- ...Thanks. That makes it worth it a little.
- Tell that to my legs.
- You noticed? Okay, I'll keep going.

@rule move.h.sports_wiped.tease
on move.tease
when hook=sports_wiped
- Offer to carry her home

@rule react.h.sports_wiped.tease
on react
when hook=sports_wiped move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Don't tempt me. I might say yes.
- You couldn't. ...Could you?
- Hah. In your dreams.

@rule day.h.sports_great
on day
when role=student mood=cheerful clubkind=sports
hook sports_great
opens praise,ask,invite
feel laugh
- Practice went really well today! I beat my best time.
- Great! The {club} actually worked together for once.
- I'm in a great mood. Coach said I'm getting better.
- We won the practice match at the {club}! I'm still buzzing.

@rule react.h.sports_great.bad
on react
when hook=sports_great fit=bad
- You could at least be happy for me.
- Okay, I'll go celebrate somewhere else.

@rule move.h.sports_great.praise
on move.praise
when hook=sports_great
- Say you knew she could do it

@rule react.h.sports_great.praise
on react
when hook=sports_great move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Hehe. I knew too, honestly.
- You did? Then you've got good taste.
- Thanks! Next time, come watch.

@rule move.h.sports_great.ask
on move.ask
when hook=sports_great
- Ask how she did it

@rule react.h.sports_great.ask
on react
when hook=sports_great move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I stopped thinking and just went for it.
- Practice, practice, practice. And a good breakfast.
- Secret. I'll tell you if you buy me a drink.

@rule move.h.sports_great.invite
on move.invite
when hook=sports_great
- Offer to celebrate with her

@rule react.h.sports_great.invite
on react
when hook=sports_great move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes! Something with lots of sugar.
- Okay! You're paying, though.
- Now we're talking.

@rule day.h.culture_great
on day
when role=student mood=cheerful clubkind=culture
hook culture_great
opens praise,ask,share
feel smile
- We finished something big at the {club} today. I'm so happy.
- The {club} had a good day. Everyone was in a good mood.
- I finally got it right at the {club}. It took forever.

@rule react.h.culture_great.bad
on react
when hook=culture_great fit=bad
- Never mind. It's a club thing.
- You wouldn't get it anyway.

@rule move.h.culture_great.praise
on move.praise
when hook=culture_great
- Say you'd like to see it

@rule react.h.culture_great.praise
on react
when hook=culture_great move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Really? Okay, but don't laugh.
- You can, if you come by the {club}.
- I'll show you. Once it's perfect.

@rule move.h.culture_great.ask
on move.ask
when hook=culture_great
- Ask what she finished

@rule react.h.culture_great.ask
on react
when hook=culture_great move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The thing I was stuck on for weeks. I'll explain later.
- It's hard to explain. You'd have to see it.
- A small thing. It feels big to me, though.

@rule move.h.culture_great.share
on move.share
when hook=culture_great
- Say you love when she's like this

@rule react.h.culture_great.share
on react
when hook=culture_great move=share fit=good|neutral
- Like what? ...Happy?
- Then I'll try to stay like this.
- Stop, I'll get shy.

@rule day.h.coffee_sleepy
on day
when mood=sleepy l_coffee=yes
hook coffee_sleepy
opens invite,ask,tease
fit tease=neutral
- I need coffee. A lot of coffee. Right now.
- I haven't had my coffee yet. Don't expect much from me.
- Two cups and I'm still asleep. I need a third.

@rule react.h.coffee_sleepy.bad
on react
when hook=coffee_sleepy fit=bad
- Talk to me after coffee.
- Not before coffee, please.

@rule move.h.coffee_sleepy.invite
on move.invite
when hook=coffee_sleepy
- Offer to get her a coffee

@rule react.h.coffee_sleepy.invite
on react
when hook=coffee_sleepy move=invite fit=good|neutral
- You're a saint. Black, please.
- Yes. Yes. Let's go.
- I'd marry you for that. ...Joking. Mostly.

@rule move.h.coffee_sleepy.ask
on move.ask
when hook=coffee_sleepy
- Ask how many she's had

@rule react.h.coffee_sleepy.ask
on react
when hook=coffee_sleepy move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Two. Don't judge me.
- Not enough. That's the answer.
- I stopped counting. That's bad, isn't it.

@rule move.h.coffee_sleepy.tease
on move.tease
when hook=coffee_sleepy
- Say she runs on coffee

@rule react.h.coffee_sleepy.tease
on react
when hook=coffee_sleepy move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Like a car runs on gas. It's science.
- And? It works.
- Don't take my fuel away.

@rule day.h.sweets_hungry
on day
when mood=hungry l_sweets=yes
hook sweets_hungry
opens invite,ask,share
- I've been thinking about cake through the whole class.
- I'm starving. I want something sweet so badly.
- My stomach wants a parfait. I'm not arguing with it.

@rule react.h.sweets_hungry.bad
on react
when hook=sweets_hungry fit=bad
- Don't make me think about food if you're not feeding me.
- Hungry and annoyed now. Great.

@rule move.h.sweets_hungry.invite
on move.invite
when hook=sweets_hungry
- Offer to get something sweet together

@rule react.h.sweets_hungry.invite
on react
when hook=sweets_hungry move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes! Right now, before I faint.
- You get me. Let's go.
- Okay, but I'm not sharing.

@rule move.h.sweets_hungry.ask
on move.ask
when hook=sweets_hungry
- Ask what she's craving

@rule react.h.sweets_hungry.ask
on react
when hook=sweets_hungry move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Cream puffs. Or anything with strawberries.
- Something with chocolate. No, wait, both.
- Sweet. Big. Now.

@rule move.h.sweets_hungry.share
on move.share
when hook=sweets_hungry
- Say you could eat dessert too

@rule react.h.sweets_hungry.share
on react
when hook=sweets_hungry move=share fit=good|neutral
- Then let's not pretend we're having a real lunch.
- Partner in crime.
- Good, I won't be the only one.

@rule day.h.spicy_hungry
on day
when mood=hungry l_spicy=yes
hook spicy_hungry
opens invite,ask,tease
- I'm hungry, and I want something so spicy it hurts.
- I keep thinking about hot ramen. I'm going to lose it.
- My stomach wants curry. The hot one.

@rule react.h.spicy_hungry.bad
on react
when hook=spicy_hungry fit=bad
- Don't talk about food if we're not going.
- I'm too hungry to be nice right now.

@rule move.h.spicy_hungry.invite
on move.invite
when hook=spicy_hungry
- Offer to go eat something spicy

@rule react.h.spicy_hungry.invite
on react
when hook=spicy_hungry move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes! Don't cry when it's too hot.
- Okay! I know just the place.
- You're on. Bring water.

@rule move.h.spicy_hungry.ask
on move.ask
when hook=spicy_hungry
- Ask how spicy she can take

@rule react.h.spicy_hungry.ask
on react
when hook=spicy_hungry move=ask fit=good|neutral
- More than you, I promise.
- Until I can't feel my face.
- Try me.

@rule move.h.spicy_hungry.tease
on move.tease
when hook=spicy_hungry
- Say she'll burn her tongue

@rule react.h.spicy_hungry.tease
on react
when hook=spicy_hungry move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Worth it. Every time.
- That's the fun part.
- I'll burn yours first.

@rule day.h.exercise_bored
on day
when mood=bored l_exercise=yes
hook exercise_bored
opens invite,ask,share
fit tease=neutral
- I've been sitting all day. I want to run until I can't.
- Too much sitting. My legs are going crazy.
- I'm so bored. I just want to move.

@rule react.h.exercise_bored.bad
on react
when hook=exercise_bored fit=bad
- Sitting here and listening to that won't help.
- You're making me even more restless.

@rule move.h.exercise_bored.invite
on move.invite
when hook=exercise_bored
- Offer to go for a run with her

@rule react.h.exercise_bored.invite
on react
when hook=exercise_bored move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Now you're talking. Try to keep up.
- Yes! Right after class.
- Okay! Loser buys drinks.

@rule move.h.exercise_bored.ask
on move.ask
when hook=exercise_bored
- Ask what she'd rather be doing

@rule react.h.exercise_bored.ask
on react
when hook=exercise_bored move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Anything with a ball in it.
- Running. Swimming. Not sitting.
- Moving. That's the whole list.

@rule move.h.exercise_bored.share
on move.share
when hook=exercise_bored
- Say you're stiff from sitting too

@rule react.h.exercise_bored.share
on react
when hook=exercise_bored move=share fit=good|neutral
- Then stretch with me. Right now.
- See? It's not just me.
- Classes should have a break to run around.

@rule day.h.animals_happy
on day
when mood=cheerful l_animals=yes
hook animals_happy
opens ask,invite,tease
feel laugh
- I saw a kitten by the gate this morning! I'm still smiling.
- A dog waved at me. Okay, it wagged at me. Same thing.
- Best day ever. There's a cat sleeping by the gym and it let me pet it.

@rule react.h.animals_happy.bad
on react
when hook=animals_happy fit=bad
- You don't care about the kitten, do you.
- Fine. I'll tell the cat instead.

@rule move.h.animals_happy.ask
on move.ask
when hook=animals_happy
- Ask what it looked like

@rule react.h.animals_happy.ask
on react
when hook=animals_happy move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Tiny and orange. And so fluffy.
- Gray with white paws, like socks.
- Cute. Very cute. Too cute.

@rule move.h.animals_happy.invite
on move.invite
when hook=animals_happy
- Say you want to see it too

@rule react.h.animals_happy.invite
on react
when hook=animals_happy move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Let's go! Maybe it's still there.
- Okay, but be quiet or it'll run.
- Come on, before it leaves.

@rule move.h.animals_happy.tease
on move.tease
when hook=animals_happy
- Say she's cuter than the cat

@rule react.h.animals_happy.tease
on react
when hook=animals_happy move=tease fit=good|neutral
- ...Don't compare me to a cat.
- Wh-what? Stop it.
- You're just saying that.

@rule day.h.gf_better
on day
when mood=none|cheerful rel=girlfriend
hook gf_better
opens share,tease,invite
feel smile
- Better now. You took long enough.
- Good. It got better the moment you showed up.
- Okay until now. Now it's nice.
- I was waiting for you. The day was okay, but this is better.

@rule react.h.gf_better.bad
on react
when hook=gf_better fit=bad
- And just like that, it's worse again.
- You know how to ruin a good moment.

@rule move.h.gf_better.share
on move.share
when hook=gf_better
- Say you were looking forward to seeing her

@rule react.h.gf_better.share
on react
when hook=gf_better move=share fit=good|neutral
- Me too. Don't make me say it twice.
- Good. You'd better have been.
- Then stay a little longer.

@rule move.h.gf_better.tease
on move.tease
when hook=gf_better
- Say she missed you

@rule react.h.gf_better.tease
on react
when hook=gf_better move=tease fit=good|neutral
- ...Maybe. Don't let it go to your head.
- So what if I did?
- Hmph. Only a little.

@rule move.h.gf_better.invite
on move.invite
when hook=gf_better
- Ask her to spend the rest of the day with you

@rule react.h.gf_better.invite
on react
when hook=gf_better move=invite fit=good|neutral
- I was hoping you'd ask.
- Okay. Where are we going?
- Of course. Did you think I'd say no?

@rule day.h.lunch_good
on day
when mood=cheerful period=lunch
hook lunch_good
opens ask,share,invite
feel smile
- Lunch was really good today. I'm in a great mood.
- I got the last melon bread. Today's a good day.
- Full and happy. That's all I need.

@rule react.h.lunch_good.bad
on react
when hook=lunch_good fit=bad
- Don't ruin my lunch mood.
- You just ruined a perfectly good lunch.

@rule move.h.lunch_good.ask
on move.ask
when hook=lunch_good
- Ask what she had

@rule react.h.lunch_good.ask
on react
when hook=lunch_good move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Curry, and a pudding after. Perfect.
- Melon bread. The last one. I won.
- My own bento. I'm getting good at it.

@rule move.h.lunch_good.share
on move.share
when hook=lunch_good
- Say your lunch was a disappointment

@rule react.h.lunch_good.share
on react
when hook=lunch_good move=share fit=good|neutral
- Aw. You should've come with me.
- Then tomorrow, eat where I eat.
- Ha! Better luck tomorrow.

@rule move.h.lunch_good.invite
on move.invite
when hook=lunch_good
- Offer to have lunch together tomorrow

@rule react.h.lunch_good.invite
on react
when hook=lunch_good move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Sure! I'll show you the good spot.
- Okay. Don't be late, or the bread runs out.
- It's a date. A lunch date.

@rule day.h.after_free
on day
when mood=none period=after
hook after_free
opens ask,invite,share
- Classes are finally over. I can breathe again.
- Done for today. Now the good part starts.
- It was long, but it's over. That's what counts.

@rule react.h.after_free.bad
on react
when hook=after_free fit=bad
- Let me enjoy being free for a minute.
- Don't remind me of class now.

@rule move.h.after_free.ask
on move.ask
when hook=after_free
- Ask what she's doing now

@rule react.h.after_free.ask
on react
when hook=after_free move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Nothing planned. That's the best part.
- Going home, probably. Unless something comes up.
- I was going to decide right now, actually.

@rule move.h.after_free.invite
on move.invite
when hook=after_free
- Ask if she wants to hang out

@rule react.h.after_free.invite
on react
when hook=after_free move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Sure. I've got time.
- Okay. Somewhere not in a classroom.
- Why not. Where to?

@rule move.h.after_free.share
on move.share
when hook=after_free
- Say you're glad the day's over too

@rule react.h.after_free.share
on react
when hook=after_free move=share fit=good|neutral
- Right? That last class went on forever.
- Let's never talk about it again.
- Free at last.

@rule day.h.upset_test
on day
when role=student mood=upset exam=yes
hook upset_test
opens comfort,ask,invite
feel pout
fit comfort=good
- I bombed a test. Don't ask which one.
- I studied, and I still blanked. I'm so mad.
- Bad. I got a test back and I don't want to talk about it.

@rule react.h.upset_test.bad
on react
when hook=upset_test fit=bad
- See, I knew I shouldn't have said anything.
- Thanks. I feel so much better. Not.

@rule move.h.upset_test.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=upset_test
- Say one test doesn't decide anything

@rule react.h.upset_test.comfort
on react
when hook=upset_test move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...Maybe. It feels like it does today.
- I needed someone to say that.
- Okay. I'll try to believe you.

@rule move.h.upset_test.ask
on move.ask
when hook=upset_test
- Ask what went wrong

@rule react.h.upset_test.ask
on react
when hook=upset_test move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I knew it, and then my head went blank.
- I studied the wrong chapter. Classic.
- Everything. Everything went wrong.

@rule move.h.upset_test.invite
on move.invite
when hook=upset_test
- Offer to study together for the next one

@rule react.h.upset_test.invite
on react
when hook=upset_test move=invite fit=good|neutral
- You'd do that? Okay... thanks.
- Fine. But you're explaining everything.
- Okay. I won't let it happen twice.

@rule day.h.bored_rain
on day
when mood=bored wet=yes
hook bored_rain
opens ask,invite,share
feel pout
fit tease=neutral
- It's raining, so there's nothing to do. Again.
- Stuck inside all day with the rain. I'm going crazy.
- The rain killed every plan I had today.

@rule react.h.bored_rain.bad
on react
when hook=bored_rain fit=bad
- That's not helping me feel less trapped.
- Great. Rain and you being like that.

@rule move.h.bored_rain.ask
on move.ask
when hook=bored_rain
- Ask what she had planned

@rule react.h.bored_rain.ask
on react
when hook=bored_rain move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I wanted to go out after class. Now look.
- Nothing big, but I wanted to do it.
- I was going to sit in the sun. Ha.

@rule move.h.bored_rain.invite
on move.invite
when hook=bored_rain
- Offer to find something to do inside

@rule react.h.bored_rain.invite
on react
when hook=bored_rain move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Okay, as long as it's not homework.
- Anything. I'll take anything.
- You'd better have a good idea.

@rule move.h.bored_rain.share
on move.share
when hook=bored_rain
- Say rain makes you lazy too

@rule react.h.bored_rain.share
on react
when hook=bored_rain move=share fit=good|neutral
- Right? It's like my battery's empty.
- Then let's be lazy together.
- At least someone gets it.

@rule day.h.lonely_friends
on day
when role=student mood=lonely rel=friend|lover|girlfriend days=many
hook lonely_friends
opens comfort,ask,invite
feel sad
fit comfort=good
- Everyone's busy today. I've been on my own since morning.
- My friends all had somewhere to be. So it's been quiet.
- I ate lunch alone today. It was strange.

@rule react.h.lonely_friends.bad
on react
when hook=lonely_friends fit=bad
- Okay. I'll go back to being alone, then.
- You're not making it better.

@rule move.h.lonely_friends.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=lonely_friends
- Say she's not alone right now

@rule react.h.lonely_friends.comfort
on react
when hook=lonely_friends move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...Yeah. That's true. Thanks.
- You always show up when I need it.
- Okay. Stay a little, then.

@rule move.h.lonely_friends.ask
on move.ask
when hook=lonely_friends
- Ask where everyone went

@rule react.h.lonely_friends.ask
on react
when hook=lonely_friends move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Club stuff, dates, homework. Everyone has something.
- I don't know. They just disappeared.
- I didn't ask. I didn't want to sound needy.

@rule move.h.lonely_friends.invite
on move.invite
when hook=lonely_friends
- Ask her to spend the afternoon with you

@rule react.h.lonely_friends.invite
on react
when hook=lonely_friends move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Really? Yes. Please.
- I was hoping you'd say that.
- Okay. Don't change your mind.

@rule day.h.stressed_homework
on day
when role=student mood=stressed exam=no period=day|lunch
hook stressed_homework
opens comfort,ask,invite
feel worried
- Too much homework. I don't know where to start.
- Three assignments due this week. I'm drowning.
- My head's full. Too many things to remember.

@rule react.h.stressed_homework.bad
on react
when hook=stressed_homework fit=bad
- Please don't add one more thing to my list.
- I don't need that right now.

@rule move.h.stressed_homework.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=stressed_homework
- Say she'll get through it one at a time

@rule react.h.stressed_homework.comfort
on react
when hook=stressed_homework move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- One at a time... okay. I can do one.
- You make it sound easy. Thanks.
- I'll try. Don't leave yet, though.

@rule move.h.stressed_homework.ask
on move.ask
when hook=stressed_homework
- Ask which one worries her most

@rule react.h.stressed_homework.ask
on react
when hook=stressed_homework move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The report. It's huge, and I haven't started.
- The math one. Always the math one.
- All of them, equally. That's the problem.

@rule move.h.stressed_homework.invite
on move.invite
when hook=stressed_homework
- Offer to work on it together

@rule react.h.stressed_homework.invite
on react
when hook=stressed_homework move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Would you? That'd help so much.
- Okay. But we really work, no slacking.
- Thank you. Library, after class?

@rule day.h.short_reach
on day
when mood=none height=short
hook short_reach
opens ask,tease,share
feel pout
fit tease=neutral
- I couldn't reach the top shelf in the library. Again. Don't laugh.
- Someone put my bag on the high shelf. It took me forever to get it.
- The board was too high to erase. I had to jump. Everyone saw.

@rule react.h.short_reach.bad
on react
when hook=short_reach fit=bad
- I said don't laugh.
- Okay, that's enough about my height.

@rule move.h.short_reach.ask
on move.ask
when hook=short_reach
- Ask if she wants you to reach things for her

@rule react.h.short_reach.ask
on react
when hook=short_reach move=ask fit=good|neutral
- ...Maybe. Just sometimes.
- I can do it myself! ...With a chair.
- Only if you don't make a face.

@rule move.h.short_reach.tease
on move.tease
when hook=short_reach
- Say she's just the right size

@rule react.h.short_reach.tease
on react
when hook=short_reach move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Right size for what? Explain.
- Hmph. Nice save.
- Says the person who's never had to jump.

@rule move.h.short_reach.share
on move.share
when hook=short_reach
- Say you'd have helped if you were there

@rule react.h.short_reach.share
on react
when hook=short_reach move=share fit=good|neutral
- Then be there next time.
- Good. Next time, I'll call you.
- That's sweet. Annoying, but sweet.
